#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2 35460ea7c5d846628017d7790fefee6f
msgid "_`Foundation corrections`"
msgstr ""
"_`地基修正`"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:4 fd47f9cdd3824544bfaac16b2bb87925
msgid ""
"Every claim in this documentation rests on a measurement, and every "
"measurement rests on code that could be wrong. This page is the record of"
" the times it was: what broke, how it surfaced, what it invalidated, and "
"what was re-run afterwards."
msgstr ""
"本文档中的每条主张都立在一次测量之上，而每次测量又立在可能出错的代码之上"
"。本页记录的是它出错的那些时候：什么坏了，怎么暴露出来，它作废了什么，之"
"后又重跑了什么。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:7 218724d018fa44b2b0c46fe07eeded07
msgid ""
"It is **append-only**. A row is never deleted or softened, including the "
"rows that are unflattering -- a wave's proportion of \"the library was "
"wrong\" to \"I was wrong\" is information about the library, and erasing "
"it would destroy the only evidence there is."
msgstr ""
"本页 **只增不改** 。任何一行都不会被删除或淡化，包括不好看的那几行——“库"
"错了”与“我错了”在一波中的比例，本身就是关于这个库的信息，抹掉它等于销毁"
"唯一的证据。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:11 a3a8b893fdbf4637b8bc137da9f8a825
msgid ""
"Why a page rather than discipline: the failure this guards against is not"
" forgetting a bug, it is a wrong number becoming *reference data*. Once a"
" figure is written into a comparison or a golden trace, every later check"
" endorses it, and the error stops looking like an error. A row here is "
"what lets a reader ask \"was this measured before or after that was "
"fixed\"."
msgstr ""
"为什么要一页记录而不是靠自觉：这里要防的失败不是忘掉一个缺陷，而是一个错"
"数变成 *参考数据* 。一个数字一旦写进某次对照或某条黄金轨迹，之后每一次检"
"查都在给它背书，错误就不再像错误。有此一行，读者才能问出“这个数是在那次"
"修复之前还是之后测的”。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:17 ecdc31d1439744bf9b67a029cc2b5020
msgid "Three classes, and they are deliberately not merged"
msgstr ""
"三个类别，且刻意不合并"

