#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:87 1f345303b0684fd78c47875d0117b928
msgid ""
"`foc_bridge_hfi_max_inject_hz` was declared in the wrong place twice: "
"once outside the `extern \"C\"` block, so the name was mangled, and once "
"inside `#ifdef __cplusplus`, so a C translation unit could not see it at "
"all."
msgstr ""
"`foc_bridge_hfi_max_inject_hz` 有两次声明在了错误的位置：一次在 `extern"
"\"C\"` 块之外，符号因此被 mangle；一次在 `#ifdef __cplusplus` 之内，C 翻"
"译单元根本看不到它。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:89 2d4cc81a48904e54aa18e5882e943548
