#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:199 498307d83b3f40359b410ec8f54cd704
msgid ""
"Wiring the `pil` gate and running it: two undefined references at link "
"time. Nothing had executed the script since W7-a, so \"the PIL leg "
"exists\" was true of the file and false of the build -- a distinction no "
"amount of reading would have settled."
msgstr ""
"接上并运行 `pil` 门禁时，链接期出现两个未定义引用。自 W7-a 之后没有任何"
"东西执行过这个脚本，于是“PIL 这条腿存在”对文件为真、对构建为假——这个区别"
"再怎么读也定不下来。"

