#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:703 322d29d051164d00a44a837901005bf5
msgid ""
"A step I added to the shared test workflow to install numpy decided "
"whether to run with `enabled=$(python3 -c \"... is True\")` and then "
"compared `\"$enabled\"` against the string `true`. Python prints `True`, "
"so the comparison never matched and the step took the else branch on "
"every machine, printing \"enable_python_bindings is off\" about a flag "
"that was on. It was inert, and it looked healthy in the diff."
msgstr ""
"我为共享测试工作流加过一个装 numpy 的步骤，它用 `enabled=$(python3 -c \""
"... is True\")` 决定是否运行，然后把 `\"$enabled\"` 与字符串 `true` 比较"
"。Python 打印的是 `True` ，于是比较从未命中，该步骤在每台机器上都走了"
"else 分支，对一个本来开着的标志打印“enable_python_bindings is off”。它是"
"惰性的，而在 diff 里看起来是健康的。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:707 6e0560fb727e42b2965e3e7599d5117c
msgid ""
"Run 40817097696, both test legs, line 226: `enable_python_bindings is "
"off: the python consumer is not built, nothing to satisfy`, while "
"`metadata.json` says `\"enable_python_bindings\": true`. The case failed "
"40 lines later with \"numpy is missing from this interpreter\", which is "
"the only reason the gate was caught."
msgstr ""
"运行 40817097696，两条测试腿，第 226 行： `enable_python_bindings is"
"off:the python consumer is not built, nothing to satisfy` ，而 `"
"metadata.json` 说 `\"enable_python_bindings\": true` 。用例在 40 行之后"
"以“numpy ismissing from this interpreter”失败，这是这道门禁被抓住的唯一"
"原因。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:710 11bdaeac67e5414e914676b64e635da7
msgid ""
"The numpy-named step is gone; what stands in its place is F-15's file-"
"driven hook, where the package name does not appear in the workflow at "
"all. The rule that outlives both: a boolean crossing from Python to the "
"shell crosses as an **exit status**, not as a printed word -- `sys.exit(0"
" if ... else 1)` has no case to get wrong and no string to compare."
msgstr ""
