#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:904 c130e01a2da84b77ab8c3416d32ed6fd
msgid ""
"Run 40840909635 spent 489 s in the cross-compile legs' `apt-get install "
"gcc-arm-none-eabi`, and the natural reading -- \"the Conan cache is "
