"archives` copied into and back out of `/var/cache/apt/archives`) and it "
"was thrown away for the baseline file. What a rewrite loses is what "
"someone else's incident paid for: `DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive` with "
"`Dpkg::Options` (a prompt on a hosted runner is a hang, bounded only by "
"the 30-minute step timeout), `restore-keys` so a workflow edit still gets"
" a partial hit, and an `if: always()` chown standing between a root-owned"
" `partial/` and a silently failed save. `git diff` against v0.3.1 is now "
"empty for that file."
msgstr ""
"第一次尝试就是这样一个手写的下载缓存（把 `~/.cache/apt-archives` 拷进 `"
"/var/cache/apt/archives` 再拷出来），为了基线文件被丢弃。一次重写会丢掉"
"的，是别人一次事故换来的东西：带 `Dpkg::Options` 的 `DEBIAN_FRONTEND="
"noninteractive` （托管 runner 上的一次提示就是挂死，只有 30 分钟的步骤超"
"时兜底）、 `restore-keys` （工作流改过之后仍能拿到部分命中），以及一道 `"
"if: always()` 的 chown，挡在 root 拥有的 `partial/` 与一次静默失败的保存"
"之间。该文件现在对 v0.3.1 的 `git diff` 是空的。"

