"一行 L2 被提升为 L3，而它需要三样东西，却只有两样。频率主张有解析锚点，"
"也有（自 A-35 起）一个独立的见证，但没有敏感度表：仓库自己对 L3 的定义是"
"“L2 **以及** 每个误差源的敏感度 **以及** 相变量交叉检验”。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1142 58419622fad34f1dbde5c91ce4c54059
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Eleven model error sources were injected one at a time into the same "
"start, at the magnitudes `test_sil_sensitivity.cpp` already uses. The "
"oscillation frequency stayed within 3.3 % of the clean run for every one;"
" the worst slip stayed within +18.2 %. One source is material: "
"**differential sensor gain** (`u+10 v-10 %`, +18.2 % slip), so it goes on"
" the user-must-measure list. The `sources` order in the test is anchored "
"**by name** rather than by index, so inserting a row cannot silently re-"
"point an assertion."
msgstr ""
"十一个模型误差源被逐个注入同一个启动过程，量级沿用 `"
"test_sil_sensitivity.cpp` 已在用的那些。振荡频率对每一个源都保持在干净运"
"行的 3.3 % 之内；最坏转差保持在 +18.2 % 之内。有一个源是有影响的： **差"
"分传感器增益** （ `u+10 v-10 %` ，转差 +18.2 %），所以它进了“用户必须测"
"量”的清单。测试里 `sources` 的顺序按 **名字** 锚定而不是按索引，于是插入"
"一行不可能悄悄把某条断言指到别处。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1147 b84a96101d1549c4a869ec725a73f240
msgid ""
"The table needed a new knob to be honest -- current-sense gain and offset"
" were private to `test_sil_sensitivity.cpp`'s own HAL, so the startup "
"bench could not inject them at all. They are now "
"`PlantCurrentSense::set_phase_gain/set_offset_a`, defaulting to identity."
" Two *analytic* anchors keep the table from measuring the harness: a "
"common offset moves the slip by < 0.1 % (it cancels identically in "
"Clarke), and a differential gain must move more than a uniform one "
"(phantom negative sequence vs a loop-gain scale). Both hold."
msgstr ""
"这张表要诚实就需要一个新旋钮——电流采样的增益与偏置原本是 `"
"test_sil_sensitivity.cpp` 自己 HAL 的私有物，启动台架根本注入不了。它们"
"现在是 `PlantCurrentSense::set_phase_gain/set_offset_a` ，默认是恒等。两"
"个 *解析* 锚点防止这张表去测台架本身：共模偏置使转差变化 < 0.1 %（它在"
"Clarke 变换里完全抵消），而差分增益必须比均匀增益动得更多（虚假负序，对"
"照环路增益尺度）。两条都成立。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1154 1b2141674afa44c7bef99c513a256cd1
