"A-37"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1156 be5ab4cb737e4af594a86ef51fdfce9a
msgid ""
"The first rule set for that table was mine and it was wrong. It declared "
"\"a source that moves the slip by 2 %-20 %\" a red state -- neither "
"negligible nor actionable. It went red, on exactly the two sensor-gain "
"rows (2.2 % and 18.2 %), which is the signature of a rule that describes "
"where two thresholds were placed rather than the machine."
msgstr ""
"那张表的第一套规则是我定的，而它是错的。它把“使转差变化 2 %-20 % 的源”判"
"成红状态——既不算可忽略，也不算可行动。它变红了，恰好红在那两行传感器增益"
"上（2.2 % 与 18.2 %），这正是一条只描述两个阈值被放在哪里、而不描述电机"
"的规则的印记。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1160 dcbc2d71e77b47a081d73b7036ef6734
msgid ""
"The red came from the first run of the rule, before any threshold was "
"moved to accommodate it."
