"这次红来自该规则的第一次运行，在任何阈值被挪去迁就它之前。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1161 fd15ee9d647b4df1b0bb9d2b3a13abb2
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Replaced by two arithmetic anchors (A-36). A second instrument error was "
"found in the same pass: the frequency was counted as `pi * crossings / "
"pull_s`, quantised at 3.14 rad/s = 5 % of the value, which made every "
"\"unchanged\" cell a statement about the counting. "
"`slip_frequency_rad_s()` times the crossings instead, and the test "
"asserts the timed and the counted value agree within 2 % so the two "
"measures cannot drift apart."
msgstr ""
"改由两个算术锚点取代（A-36）。同一遍里还发现了第二处仪器错误：频率被算成"
" `pi * crossings / pull_s` ，量化在 3.14 rad/s 上，等于该值的 5 %，于是"
"一个个“未变”的单元格都成了关于计数的陈述。 `slip_frequency_rad_s()` 改为"
"给穿越计时，而测试断言计时值与计数值的差在 2 % 之内，这样两种测量无法彼"
"此漂开。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1166 f61eb0e2aabd45949df1451e75228889
msgid "F-39"
msgstr ""
"F-39"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1168 b82635572ae142499ce6a8e8e6446278
msgid ""
"An origin could not exist through the C ABI at all. `PositionReference` "
"is advanced only while the commutation angle comes from the *observer* "
"(`speed_from_observer || injecting_now()`), and "
"`CallbackPosition::has_sensor()` was hard-coded `true` with "
"`velocity_rad_s()` returning `0.0` (not `NaN`) when the callback was "
"absent. So `speed_from_observer` was always false on the host path: the "
"reference never advanced, `homed()` could never become true, and "
"\"absolute position\" was a concept the C surface could neither reach nor"
" report. The gap was invisible because the C surface never mentioned it, "
"and the C++ path (which the SIL tests use) has "
"`PlantPosition::set_sensor_present(false)`."
msgstr ""
"原点通过 C ABI 根本不可能存在。 `PositionReference` 只在换相角来自 *观测"
"器* 时才被推进（ `speed_from_observer || injecting_now()` ），而 `"
"CallbackPosition::has_sensor()` 硬编码为 `true` ， `velocity_rad_s()` 在"
"回调缺失时返回 `0.0` （不是 `NaN` ）。于是在宿主路径上 `"
"speed_from_observer` 永远是假：参考从不推进， `homed()` 永远不会变真，而"
"“绝对位置”成了 C 接口既够不到也报不出的概念。这个缺口不可见，因为 C 接口"
"从未提到它，而 C++ 路径（SIL 测试用的那条）有 `"
"PlantPosition::set_sensor_present(false)` 。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1175 9f0930f8622041dba5ed2738c9922603
msgid ""
"Asking what a caller could *do* with the refusal I had just added: the "
"answer was \"nothing, forever\". A query whose success branch cannot be "
"reached is a deleted feature with extra steps, so the branch was traced "
"back to the flag that keeps it false."
msgstr ""
"去问调用方对我刚加上的那个拒绝能 *做什么* ：答案是“什么也做不了，永远”。"
"一个成功分支不可达的查询，就是一个多绕了几步的删除功能，于是这个分支被回"
"溯到那个让它保持为假的标志。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1178 2f1069c5e4a74d59bd90ac65ae0a8c53
msgid ""
"Three additions, all append-only and `struct_size`-gated: "
"`foc_motor_setup_t::use_observer_angle`, the optional "
"`position_has_index`/`position_index_pulse` HAL callbacks, and "
"`HalCallbacks::valid_without_angle()` so a sensor-less host may omit the "
"angle callback (a *second predicate* rather than a flag, because "
"\"sensored host without an angle\" is a configuration mistake while "
"\"sensor-less host without one\" is the normal case, and one predicate "
"would spell them the same). The callbacks struct is an *input*, so its "
"appended fields are gated by the caller's `struct_size` -- reading them "
"unguarded would read an older caller's stack."
msgstr ""
"三处新增，全部只追加并由 `struct_size` 门控： `"
"foc_motor_setup_t::use_observer_angle` 、可选的 `position_has_index` /`"
"position_index_pulse` HAL 回调，以及 `HalCallbacks::valid_without_angle("
")` ，好让无感宿主可以省掉角度回调（一个 *第二谓词* 而不是一个标志，因为“"
"有传感的宿主却没有角度”是配置错误，而“无感宿主没有角度”是正常情形，一个"
"谓词会把两者写成一样）。回调结构是 *输入* ，所以它追加的字段由调用方的 `"
"struct_size` 门控——不加守卫地去读，会读到更早调用方的栈。"

