"F-44"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1483 172a28b1e9ae49249d7a757296831254
msgid ""
"`motion_profile.hpp`'s rationale promised \"accel-limited motion with a "
"stopping distance that matches the deceleration it is allowed\", stated "
"as a property of a move. It is a property of the *command*. The axis "
"covers `v^2/(2a)` only if it tracks the command exactly; when the inner "
"loop lags, the axis passes the threshold and keeps going."
msgstr ""
"`motion_profile.hpp` 的论述承诺“加速度受限的运动，其停止距离与它被允许的"
"减速度相匹配”，把它说成一次移动的性质。它是 *指令* 的性质。轴只有在精确"
"跟随指令时才走完 `v^2/(2a)` ；内环一滞后，轴就越过阈值继续走。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1487 78d75fb611d04443a6b47c183c43bc68
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The row was being promoted to L3 and the deficit had to be written down "
"as a number rather than as a caveat: the axis passes the deceleration "
"threshold at **86.3 % of it** (a 27.4 mrad deficit on a 1 rad move). The "
"documentation simply had no place to put that number, which is how it "
"stayed unwritten. This is the same class as F-42 -- a shipped sentence "
"making a quantitative promise without its domain -- and it was found the "
"same way, by deriving what the claim should say instead of re-reading "
"what it does say."
msgstr ""
"这一行正要升到 L3，而缺口必须写成一个数字而不是一句免责声明：轴越过减速"
"阈值时只到它的 **86.3 %** （1 rad 的移动上差 27.4 mrad）。文档里根本没有"
"地方放这个数字，它就是这样一直没被写下来。这与 F-42 同一类——一句已交付的"
"话做出定量承诺却不给适用域——而发现它的方式也相同：推导这条主张该说什么，"
"而不是重读它现在说了什么。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1493 f3368926f0174e8d8e9ce824755d85e0
msgid ""
"Header prose only. What it changes is that a reader can no longer take "
"`v^2/(2a)` as a bound on a real axis; the L3 claim row carries the "
"measured deficit."
msgstr ""
"只改头文件里的文字。它改变的是：读者不再能把 `v^2/(2a)` 当作真实轴上的一"
"个界；L3 主张行承载实测的缺口。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1496 d351ed68b80e4400b2208267ad423624
msgid "A-49"
msgstr ""
"A-49"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:1498 b097fe1e0eb44bfba6942c3fd34cf03d
msgid ""
"`motion_profile` reaches L3 through O-5. This is the first row where **no"
" code defect was found**, and the analysis was wrong instead, three "
"times, in three different ways."
msgstr ""
"`motion_profile` 经由 O-5 达到 L3。这是第一行 **没有找到代码缺陷** 的行"
