#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2337 a68584dbf8c3406cb75a73b2a3ce645d
msgid "F-80"
msgstr ""
"F-80"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2339 2b7d94d0e2b54a989d93a82f72e23555
msgid ""
"Two more defects in the C-step tooling, both of the same shape -- a post-"
"processing call that fails silently or loudly at the wrong moment. (1) "
"`mo_getpointvalues` returns **nothing** for a point that lies exactly on "
"a region boundary, and my generator's guard was written so that a single "
"such point (the first probe sat on the antiperiodic edge, and after that "
"on the mid-gap circle) turned *every* row into `nan`: 45 of 45. (2) "
"`mo_getcircuitproperties` returns a **number**, not a table; the shipped "
"Octave wrapper returns an array, so indexing the Lua result (`z[1]`) "
"produced `attempt to index global z (a number value)` and killed a run "
"after it had already paid for its solve."
msgstr ""
"C 步工具里又有两个缺陷，形状相同——一次后处理调用在错误的时刻静默地或响亮"
"地失败。(1) `mo_getpointvalues` 对正好落在区域边界上的点返回 **空** ，而"
"生成器里的守卫写成只要有一个这样的点（第一个探针坐在反周期边上，之后又坐"
"在中隙圆上）， *每一* 行都变成 `nan` ：45 行里 45 行都成。(2) `"
"mo_getcircuitproperties` 返回一个 **数** ，不是表；随发行版的 Octave 包"
"装返回数组，于是对 Lua 结果做索引（ `z[1]` ）产生 `attempt to index"
"global z(a number value)` ，在一次已经为解算付过代价的运行末尾把它杀掉。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2346 2530376351294a4c9796b92e61296cb6
msgid ""
"(1) was found by adding three diagnostic points that must lie inside "
"material (origin, rotor, stator) and printing `nil` explicitly instead of"
" letting `write()` throw; that immediately separated \"postprocessor has "
"no solution\" from \"this point is bad\". (2) was found by the modal "
"dialog naming the exact line."
msgstr ""
"(1) 是靠加入三个必定落在材料内部的诊断点（原点、转子、定子）并显式打印 `"
"nil` 、而不是让 `write()` 抛出来找到的；那立刻把“后处理器没有解”与“这个"
"点有问题”分开了。(2) 是靠模态对话框指出确切的那一行找到的。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2349 f31926b3a33b4b8ba2eefc72e7cfeb0d
msgid ""
"Both are fixed in a way that cannot regress quietly: the probe loop "
"writes `nan` for a missing pair so the parser can count them, and the "
"circuit extraction probes `type(a) == \"table\"` at run time and reports "
"which convention it found instead of assuming either. The probe grid is "
"also offset by half a step so no probe sits on an edge by construction."
msgstr ""
"两个都以不会悄悄退化的方式修好：探针循环对缺失的配对写 `nan` ，解析器因"
"此能数出它们；电路提取在运行时探测 `type(a) == \"table\"` 并报告它发现的"
"是哪种约定，而不是假定其中一种。探针栅格也偏移半个步长，于是按构造没有任"
"何探针落在边上。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2355 b5b92a95a39343e085072e4409d88dbb
msgid "F-81"
msgstr ""
"F-81"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2357 b2db704e38894df4874456412faddcfa
msgid ""
"The generator attached the iron's B-H curve **before creating the "
"material**: `mi_addbhpoint(\"iron\", ...)` sat at lines 7-35 of the Lua "
"while `mi_addmaterial(\"iron\", ...)` came later, and FEMM discards "
"`mi_addbhpoint` on a name that does not exist yet **without any "
"message**. Every \"saturating\" run in this session therefore solved the "
"*linear* problem, and the file that was supposed to test whether bridge "
"saturation restores the gap field to 0.6-1.1 T was never actually "
"nonlinear."
msgstr ""
"生成器在 **创建材料之前** 就挂了铁的 B-H 曲线： `mi_addbhpoint(\"iron\","
"...)` 在 Lua 的第 7-35 行，而 `mi_addmaterial(\"iron\", ...)` 在后面，"
"FEMM 对一个尚不存在的名字上的 `mi_addbhpoint` **不报任何消息地丢弃** 。"
"于是本次会话里每一次“饱和”运行解的都是 *线性* 问题，那个本该用来检验铁桥"
"饱和能否把气隙磁场恢复到 0.6-1.1 T 的文件，从来就不是非线性的。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2362 bdabf03743b1491d9ddf81b75e5dc35c
msgid ""
"It was caught only because two runs were diffed against each other: the "
"\"nonlinear\" result file was **bit-identical for its first 20 lines** to"
" the linear one, including `diag rotor -0.008935911975379105`. Reading "
"the new file alone would have looked completely normal. Confirmed from "
"the `.fem` afterwards: `<BlockName> = \"iron\"` with `<BHPoints> = 0`, "
"against 29 points asked for."
msgstr ""
"它被抓到只是因为把两次运行相互做了 diff：“非线性”的结果文件与线性那个 **"
"前 20 行逐位相同** ，包括 `diag rotor -0.008935911975379105` 。单读新文"
"件会显得完全正常。事后从 `.fem` 确认： `<BlockName> = \"iron\"` 配 `<"
"BHPoints> = 0` ，而要求的是 29 个点。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2366 d5ac881324ee42f8bed2fc85d11b8c34
msgid ""
"The emission order is fixed and the reason is written into the generator "
"next to the code, because this is the same defect class as the rest of "
"this session -- a control that changes nothing reads exactly like a "
"converged answer. The general rule it adds: **after adding any material "
"property, read it back out of the saved `.fem`**; a property that is "
"absent there was never applied, no matter what the script said."
msgstr ""
"写入顺序已改，理由写进了生成器并紧挨着代码，因为这与本次会话其余部分是同"
"一类缺陷——一个什么都不改变的控件，读起来恰像一个已收敛的答案。它新增的一"
"般规矩： **加任何材料属性之后，从已保存的 `.fem` 里把它读回来** ；那里不"
"存在的属性从未生效，无论脚本说了什么。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2372 b93e05688f28480fa539e52960143648
msgid "A-82"
msgstr ""
"A-82"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2374 32d377aa7ecc45628e3c1b4bbde9fe6e
msgid ""
"The saturating solve landed, and **all three criteria written before it "
"ran were met**: the gap `abs(B_r)` peak went **0.0692 T to 0.7873 T** "
"with an order-4 fundamental of **0.8503 T** against a pre-registered "
"**0.6-1.1 T**; every harmonic other than order 4 is below **1.3 %** with "
"**8** sign changes around the circumference, so the 8-pole pattern never "
"changed; and the lumped winding route gives **psi_f = 0.3858 Wb-turns** "
"against a pre-registered **0.35-0.40**, with `Kt = 2.315 N*m/A` against a"
" predicted 2.3. The `B_g1 = 0.85 T` assumed when psi_f was predicted came"
" out **0.8503 T**."
msgstr ""
"饱和解算落地， **运行之前写下的三条判据全部满足** ：气隙 `abs(B_r)` 峰值"
"从 **0.0692 T 升到 0.7873 T** ，4 次基波为 **0.8503 T** ，对照预先登记的"
" **0.6-1.1 T** ；4 次以外的每一次谐波都低于 **1.3 %** ，圆周上 **8** 次"
"变号，所以 8 极图样从未改变；集总绕组路线给出 **psi_f = 0.3858 Wb-turns*"
"* ，对照预先登记的 **0.35-0.40** ， `Kt = 2.315 N*m/A` 对照预测的 2.3。"
"预测psi_f 时假定的 `B_g1 = 0.85 T` 出来是 **0.8503 T** 。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2380 1ff5d941367944568e8d1e8f67174e15
msgid ""
"This is the first number in the whole leg that was **registered before it"
" was measured and then met**, so it is a stronger statement than the two "
"closed-form checks: those showed the solver reproduces an answer that "
"already existed, this one shows a model assumption was quantitatively "
"wrong and that correcting it lands where the physics said it would. The "
"wrong version is preserved rather than deleted -- 0.0720 T with the flux "
"short-circuited inside the rotor is what a linear bridge assumption "
"produces, and the ratio **11.8x** between the two is the size of that "
"modelling error, which is precisely the quantity this layer exists to "
"report."
msgstr ""
"这是整条支线上第一个 **先登记、后测量、然后被满足** 的数字，所以它比前面"
"两个闭式检查更有力：那两个表明求解器能复现一个已经存在的答案，这一个表明"
"一条模型假设在量上错了，而改正之后落到了物理说它该去的地方。错的那一版被"
"保留而不是删除——转子内部磁通短路的 0.0720 T 正是线性铁桥假设的产物，两者"
"之间 **11.8x** 的比值就是那个建模误差的大小，而那恰是这一层要报告的量。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2386 485e3cf3494140469cf0a48bcd22257f
msgid ""
"**The scope of the psi_f number has to be stated or it becomes a "
"different claim**: it comes from the measured gap fundamental fed through"
" the winding formula, *not* from FEMM's flux linkage. The prediction "
"named the flux-linkage fundamental, which needs a 45-degree electrical "
"sweep, and a single non-linear angle costs 44 minutes (linear 6m22), so "
"that sweep is around nine hours and is **not done**. The difference "
"between the two routes is the model-assumption error, i.e. a result in "
"itself -- the sine assumption for the gap field is not being tuned away."
msgstr ""
"**psi_f 这个数字的范围必须写明，否则它就变成另一条主张** ：它来自测到的"
"气隙基波喂进绕组公式， *不是* 来自 FEMM 的磁链。预测所说的是磁链基波，那"
"需要一次 45 度电角度的扫描，而单个非线性角度要花 44 分钟（线性 6m22），"
"于是那次扫描约九小时， **没有做** 。两条路线的差别就是模型假设误差，这本"
"身就是一个结果——气隙磁场的正弦假设没有被调着修掉。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2394 072d2200b82849dab3addfff592b6456
msgid "F-83"
msgstr ""
"F-83"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2396 0e5539b56d1e48e0985488236186390d
msgid ""
"The first loaded solve returned `exit=0` and a complete result file, and "
"**the excitation had done nothing**: with `ia,ib,ic = 100,-50,-50` A and "
"9 turns in every one of the 48 slots -- a nominal 43,200 ampere-turns "
"against the magnets' 5,864 -- the air-gap fundamental moved by **0.0000 "
"T** (peak by 0.007 T), the stator-side `diag` points by under 0.2 %, and "
"the phase flux-linkage readout was **6.5e-6 Wb-turns**, i.e. `L = 65 nH` "
"where this winding cannot be below roughly a millihenry."
msgstr ""
"第一次带载解算返回 `exit=0` 和一个完整的结果文件，而 **激励什么都没做** "
"： `ia,ib,ic = 100,-50,-50` A、48 个槽每槽 9 匝——标称 43,200 安匝，对照"
"磁体的 5,864——气隙基波移动了 **0.0000 T** （峰值 0.007 T），定子侧的 `"
"diag` 点变化不到 0.2 %，相磁链读数 **6.5e-6 Wb-turns** ，即 `L = 65 nH` "
"，而这套绕组不可能低于约一毫亨。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2401 9f2912832aa04fcaaa4e7fca5b07ea17
msgid ""
"The gap field is the validated instrument here, so the conclusion does "
"not depend on the circuit readout: a 43,200 A-turns excitation producing "
"a zero change in the order-4 component is not a converged answer, it is "
"an unapplied one. The near-miss matters more than the defect -- every "
"number in that file is formatted exactly like the no-load file that "
"passed, and `Lq = 6.2e-8 H` would have been computable, plausible-"
"looking, and wrong by five orders of magnitude."
msgstr ""
"气隙磁场在这里是已验证过的仪器，所以结论不依赖电路读数：43,200 安匝的激"
"励在 4 次分量上造成零变化，不是已收敛的答案，是未被施加的答案。差一点的"
"失控比缺陷本身更值得记——那个文件里每个数字的格式都与通过了的空载文件一样"
"，而 `Lq = 6.2e-8 H` 本可以被算出来、看起来合理、并错五个数量级。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2406 4762facebca74036bbfebdf54f2c6b4a
msgid ""
"The block labels were then read back out of the saved `.fem` against an "
"official wound example (`DoubleSidedLIM.fem`, whose label line shows "
"`Turns = -10` in the same position), which confirmed the layout is "
"`InCircuit, MagDir, Group, Turns` and that the model does carry `Turns = "
"9` with the correct per-slot phase pattern -- so the defect is **not** in"
" the winding definition and the next step is a discriminator, not a "
"guess: the same geometry solved **linear**, where `abs(B)` must scale "
"exactly with the applied ampere-turns, separates \"no current\" from "
"\"current reduced by a factor\" from \"current right and the estimate "
"wrong\"."
msgstr ""
"随后把块标签从已保存的 `.fem` 读回来，与一份官方带绕组的例子对照（ `"
"DoubleSidedLIM.fem` ，它的标签行在同一位置显示 `Turns = -10` ），确认布"
"局是 `InCircuit, MagDir, Group, Turns` ，且模型确实带着 `Turns = 9` 与正"
"确的逐槽相位图样——所以缺陷 **不在** 绕组定义里，下一步是一个判别器而不是"
"一个猜测：同一几何按 **线性** 求解，此时 `abs(B)` 必须精确随施加的安匝数"
"缩放，能把“没有电流”与“电流被缩了一个因子”与“电流对、估计错”分开。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2415 e3bf3de818af4394b0639aef3cb941ec
msgid "F-84"
msgstr ""
"F-84"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2417 dca42ea36d1a4ec9a8b8a98a062cfbef
msgid ""
"The cause of F-83, found by measuring rather than reading: the **sign of "
"a block's `turns` is what carries current direction, and the `turns` "
"argument of `mi_setblockprop` is inert in this FEMM build**. On the "
"already-validated coaxial model, `turns = 1` and `turns = 10` return a "
"**bit-identical** flux linkage (`3.714904718532582e-007`), so the block "
"stored `Turns = +/-9` in the `.fem` and the solver never saw it. Every "
"`-9` slot therefore carried the same direction as the `+9` ones."
msgstr ""
"F-83 的原因，靠测量而不是靠阅读找到： **承载电流方向的是块 `turns` 的符"
"号，而 `mi_setblockprop` 的 `turns` 参数在这个 FEMM 构建里是惰性的** 。"
"在已经验证过的同轴模型上， `turns = 1` 与 `turns = 10` 返回 **逐位相同**"
" 的磁链（ `3.714904718532582e-007` ），所以块在 `.fem` 里存了 `Turns = +"
"/-9` ，求解器从未看到它。于是每个 `-9` 槽带的方向与 `+9` 的相同。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2422 588d1124edd64cf2957c6e57163a608f
msgid ""
"The winding's period is 12 slots and that was written into the file "
"correctly; with the signs deleted it became 6 slots, and the measured "
"signature says exactly that: the current-induced field was dominated by "
"spatial **order 8** (0.0082 T) and order 16 (0.0024 T) while **order 4 "
"was 4e-6 T** -- an MMF with eight pole pairs from a winding that has "
"four. The magnitude was low by roughly fifty times for the same reason "
"(partial cancellation), which is why the first read was \"the current did"
" nothing\" rather than \"the current is the wrong shape\"."
msgstr ""
"这套绕组的周期是 12 槽，那一点在文件里写对了；符号被删掉后它变成 6 槽，"
"而测到的签名说的正是这个：电流感生的磁场由空间 **8 次** （0.0082 T）与"
"16次（0.0024 T）主导，而 **4 次只有 4e-6 T** ——一个八对极的磁动势，来自"
"一套四对极的绕组。幅值低了约五十倍也是同一原因（部分抵消），这就是最初读"
"成“电流什么都没做”而不是“电流形状不对”的原因。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2428 6fe2f2b4a1e043248d59dcb77521d293
msgid ""
"Fixed by moving direction onto **signed circuits** (`A+`, `A-`, ... `C-`)"
" with `turns` fixed at 1 and the ampere-turns carried by the circuit "
"current; the readout then has to be scaled by N to be in Wb-turns, which "
"is verified against the no-load answer rather than assumed. The two "
"defects are the same family as F-81 and as the `automesh`/`-lua-"
"var`/`mi_setarcsegmentprop` mistakes in C-73: **an argument the API "
"accepts and then ignores produces a model that looks built**. What "
"catches it is not reading the script but comparing a run against a case "
"whose answer is already known."
msgstr ""
"修法是把方向移到 **带符号的电路** 上（ `A+` 、 `A-` 、…… `C-` ）， `"
"turns` 固定为 1，安匝数由电路电流承载；读数因此要乘 N 才是 Wb-turns，而"
"这一点是对照空载答案验证的，不是假定的。这两个缺陷与 F-81 以及 C-73 里 `"
"automesh` /`-lua-var` /`mi_setarcsegmentprop` 那几处错误同族： **API 接"
"受然后忽略的实参，产出一个看起来已经建好的模型** 。抓住它的不是读脚本，"
"而是把一次运行与一个答案已知的 case 相比。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2436 5633730725ba4e7e990a45ee7481a0b7
msgid "A-85"
msgstr ""
"A-85"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2438 b7b8ca7e8ba7493f8c9d64271cb71e2f
msgid ""
"The signed-circuit fix for F-84 is verified, and the criterion was "
"written before the run: the current-induced gap field must be dominated "
"by **spatial order 4**. It is -- **order 4 = 0.3125 T** against order 20 "
"= 0.0178 T (eighteen times smaller), with order 8 gone entirely, and the "
"change's rms went from 0.0063 T to **0.2237 T** (35x). The order-8 "
"signature that diagnosed F-84 disappeared exactly as predicted once the "
"`-9` slots were allowed to carry the opposite direction."
msgstr ""
"F-84 的带符号电路修复已通过验证，判据是在运行之前写下的：电流感生的气隙"
"磁场必须由 **空间 4 次** 主导。确实如此—— **4 次 = 0.3125 T** ，对照 20"
"次 =0.0178 T（小十八倍），8 次完全消失，变化量的 rms 从 0.0063 T 升到 **"
"0.2237 T** （35x）。诊断 F-84 的那个 8 次签名，在 `-9` 槽被允许承载相反"
"方向之后，按预测精确消失了。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2443 1e6b9362d0cf4a16baeca9376bb2a5e6
msgid ""
"This is the first loaded result in the leg that is physically "
"recognisable: 900 ampere-turns per slot now produce a four-pole-pair "
"armature reaction for a winding whose pattern repeats every 12 slots, and"
" the short-circuit-proof instrument (the gap field) is what says so."
msgstr ""
"这是这条支线上第一个物理上可辨认的带载结果：每个槽 900 安匝，现在为一个"
"图样每 12 槽重复的绕组产出了四对极的电枢反应，而说出这一点的是那个不怕短"
"路的仪器（气隙磁场）。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2446 3e23c0b4f12643d98f3aa567ae6ecac4
msgid ""
"The circuit flux-linkage readout is **still not usable and no longer "
"needed**: 4.25e-4 at 900 A is some 300x below the flux the measured gap "
"field implies, so psi will be taken from the field and the winding "
"function instead. The readout stays in the file anyway -- a number wrong "
"by a constant factor is evidence about the instrument, not noise to drop."
" Two self-inflicted detours cost a turn each on the way: the fix first "
"named the saved document \"-\" because a loop variable shadowed `--tag`, "
"then hung for seven minutes on a modal dialog because post-processing "
"still probed circuits `A`/`B`/`C` that no longer existed. Both were "
"caught by reading the **generated** file rather than the patch, which is "
"the F-81 rule one layer up."
msgstr ""
"电路磁链读数 **仍然不可用，而且已不再需要** ：900 A 时的 4.25e-4 比测到"
"的气隙磁场所隐含的磁链低约 300 倍，所以 psi 改从磁场与绕组函数取。这个读"
"数仍留在文件里——一个错在常数因子上的数字是关于仪器的证据，不是可以丢掉的"
"噪声。路上有两处自找的绕路，各花掉一轮：修复先是因为一个循环变量遮蔽了 `"
"--tag` 、把保存的文档名写成了“-”，随后又在模态对话框上卡了七分钟，因为后"
"处理仍在探测已不存在的 `A` /`B` /`C` 电路。两者都是靠读 **生成的** 文件"
"而不是读补丁抓到的，这正是 F-81 那条规矩往上抬一层。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2455 37087d3e37c7409086a5e6b4ea9ae08e
msgid "F-86"
msgstr ""
"F-86"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2457 7e95b7dd5ead4ebeb1cdc69b1ebadaca
msgid ""
"**A-82's psi_f cannot be counted as a verified number, and the reason is "
"that the prediction and the measurement used the same formula.** The pre-"
"registered band 0.35-0.40 was computed as `N_ph*k_w1*B_g1*L1*2R/p` with "
"`B_g1 = 0.85 T`; the measured 0.3858 is that same expression fed the "
"measured `B_g1 = 0.8503 T`. So it confirms that the field level was "
"predicted correctly, not that psi_f was measured. Of A-82's three "
"criteria the first two -- the gap peak rising into 0.6-1.1 T and the "
"8-pole pattern surviving -- are genuinely independent and stand; the "
"psi_f line does not."
msgstr ""
"**A-82 的 psi_f 不能算作已验证的数字，原因是预测与测量用的是同一条公式。"
"** 预先登记的范围 0.35-0.40 是按 `N_ph*k_w1*B_g1*L1*2R/p` 在 `B_g1 ="
"0.85T` 下算出的；测到的 0.3858 是把测到的 `B_g1 = 0.8503 T` 喂进同一个表"
"达式的结果。所以它确认的是磁场水平被预测对了，不是 psi_f 被测到了。A-82"
"的三条判据里，前两条——气隙峰值升进 0.6-1.1 T、8 极图样存活——是真正独立的"
"，成立；psi_f 那一行不成立。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2463 4529098f76774f5cad8f296a97056f13
msgid ""
"The independent route disagrees and is not yet resolved. Taking psi from "
"the definition, `psi = L1 * sum_k N_k * A_z(theta_k)` with `A_z` "
"integrated from the measured gap field and the slots read out of the "
"`.fem` itself, gives **0.188** on the same no-load field where the lumped"
" route gives 0.386. Feeding a synthetic pure sinusoid through the same "
"two routes isolates the cause: **0.0998 against 0.3858, a factor of "
"3.87**, so it is not the field's harmonic content and not the "
"integration. The circuit readout is not a tie-breaker either -- it is "
"about 200x below what the measured field implies."
msgstr ""
"独立路线给出不同答案，且尚未解决。按定义取 psi， `psi = L1 * sum_k N_k *"
"A_z(theta_k)` ，其中 `A_z` 由测到的气隙磁场积分、槽从 `.fem` 本身读出，"
"在同一个空载磁场下给出 **0.188** ，而集总路线给出 0.386。把一条合成的纯"
"正弦喂进同样两条路线可以隔离原因： **0.0998 对照 0.3858，差 3.87 倍** ，"
"所以既不是磁场的谐波含量，也不是积分。电路读数也不是裁决者——它比测到的磁"
"场所隐含的低约 200 倍。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2469 176aa612e70e4058ab9a9c4ee496189e
msgid ""
"Deliberately not resolving it by picking the number that agrees with the "
"pre-registered band. The way out is a case whose flux linkage can be "
"computed by hand and compared against both routes, plus taking `A_z` from"
" FEMM rather than integrating `B_r`; until that is done, **no psi-derived"
" quantity (Ld, Lq, Kt) is quoted**. The loaded runs finished with "
"`exit=0` and are kept, because the fields in them are good."
msgstr ""
"有意不去挑那个与预先登记范围吻合的数字来收场。出路是一个磁链能手算、并可"
"与两条路线对照的 case，加上从 FEMM 直接取 `A_z` 而不是积分 `B_r` ；在那"
"之前， **不引用任何由 psi 导出的量（Ld、Lq、Kt）** 。带载运行以 `exit=0`"
" 结束并被保留，因为其中的磁场是好的。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2475 6aa4077368f54beaa093bb9d92748e66
msgid "A-87"
msgstr ""
"A-87"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2477 833509ea82f042c1b6e6808b75870cfa
msgid ""
"**F-86's factor of 3.87 is resolved, and the answer is that the psi_f I "
"reported was wrong by 2.05x.** Two errors sat in the same helper: `N_ph` "
"was taken as `sum(abs(turns))` over the slots, which counts every turn "
"**twice** because each turn passes through two slots (16 slots x 9 turns "
"is 8 coils, i.e. **N_ph = 72**, not 144); and `k_w1` came from the "
"machine JSON's `coil_pitch = 5`, which implies a chord factor of sin(75 "
"deg) while the winding matrix actually spans **6 slots, a full pitch**, "
"so `k_p = 1`. With both fixed the lumped route gives **psi_f = 0.18826 "
"Wb-turns** against the definition-level sum's **0.188** -- **0.1 % "
"apart**, where before they were 3.87x apart."
msgstr ""
"**F-86 的 3.87 倍已解决，答案是：我报告的 psi_f 错了 2.05 倍。** 两个错"
"误在同一个助手函数里： `N_ph` 取的是各槽 `sum(abs(turns))` ，而它把每一"
"匝 **数了两次** ，因为每匝穿过两个槽（16 槽乘 9 匝是 8 个线圈，即 **N_ph"
"= 72** ，不是 144）； `k_w1` 取自机器 JSON 的 `coil_pitch = 5` ，那隐含"
"sin(75deg) 的节距系数，而绕组矩阵实际跨 **6 个槽，即全距** ，所以 `k_p ="
"1` 。两处修好之后，集总路线给出 **psi_f = 0.18826 Wb-turns** ，对照定义"
"级求和给出的 **0.188** ——相差 **0.1 %** ，而此前两者相差 3.87 倍。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2484 4601c461e7a24c5ea0a9b011c8b787ee
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The identity that settles it needs neither coil pitch nor winding factor:"
" `abs(sum_k N_k e^{j p theta_k}) == 2 * N_ph * k_w1`. Evaluated on the "
"layout at 1 turn per slot it returns **15.455** while `2*8*0.966` is "
"**15.456**, so N_ph = 72 and k_w1 = 0.966 are read out of the model "
"instead of out of a JSON field that disagrees with it. That is what "
"turned a factor into a number."
msgstr ""
"把它定下来的是那个既不需要线圈节距、也不需要绕组系数的恒等式： `abs("
"sum_kN_k e^{j p theta_k}) == 2 * N_ph * k_w1` 。在每槽 1 匝的布局上求值"
"返回 **15.455** ，而 `2*8*0.966` 是 **15.456** ，于是 N_ph = 72 与 k_w1"
"= 0.966是从模型里读出来的，而不是从一个与模型不符的 JSON 字段里读出来的"
"。这才把一个因子变成了一个数。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2488 7923a3c0b11b441084f93283622cde03
msgid ""
"**The pre-registered band 0.35-0.40 is therefore falsified, not met**: "
"0.188 lies outside it, and it was only ever met because the prediction "
"and the measurement shared the doubled turn count (F-86 said exactly that"
" in advance). `Kt` moves from 2.315 to **1.13 N*m/A**. A-82's other two "
"criteria are untouched -- they are about the field, and the field is "
"fine: the peak rose into 0.6-1.1 T and the 8-pole pattern survived. "
"Standing rule reinforced: a prediction that shares a formula with its "
"measurement is not a prediction, and the only way to find that out is a "
"second route sharing nothing but the field."
msgstr ""
"**因此预先登记的范围 0.35-0.40 是被否证的，而不是被满足的** ：0.188 落在"
"其外，而它此前之所以被满足，只因为预测与测量共用了那个加倍过的匝数（F-86"
"事先说的正是这一点）。 `Kt` 从 2.315 变为 **1.13 N*m/A** 。A-82 的另外两"
"条判据不受影响——它们说的是磁场，而磁场是好的：峰值升进 0.6-1.1 T，8 极图"
"样存活。常设规矩得到强化：与自己的测量共用一条公式的预测不是预测，而唯一"
"能查出这一点的方式是走一条除磁场外什么都不共用的第二条路线。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2496 1573d7e2c5234ce2a3b2ff3233410ea2
msgid "A-88"
msgstr ""
"A-88"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2498 5bdbfd707ed541e298a3a04e3c1d6295
msgid ""
"**The geometric route now produces axis inductances**: two loaded solves "
"at 100 A with the current vector rotated 90 degrees apart (rotor and mesh"
" unchanged) give, from the symmetric 2x2 fit, **Ldd = 0.193 mH, Lqq = "
"0.648 mH, Ldq = -0.004 mH** -- the cross term is **2.0 %** of Ldd, and "
"**Lq/Ld = 3.36**. Both runs returned `exit=0`; psi comes from the field "
"and the winding function, not from the circuit readout."
msgstr ""
"**几何路线现在给出轴电感** ：在 100 A 下做两次带载解算，电流矢量旋转相差"
"90 度（转子与网格不变），由对称 2x2 拟合给出 **Ldd = 0.193 mH、Lqq ="
"0.648 mH、Ldq = -0.004 mH** ——交叉项是 Ldd 的 **2.0 %** ， **Lq/Ld ="
"3.36** 。两次运行都返回 `exit=0` ；psi 来自磁场与绕组函数，不是来自电路"
"读数。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2503 a7ee4e6c9635430db2cda7c634224639
msgid ""
"The interesting part is that the **d-axis stopped being an assumed "
"quantity and became a testable one**. Three candidate definitions "
"existed: the no-load flux vector (**148.47 deg**), the phase of the gap "
"field's order-4 harmonic (**-90.00 deg**), and the angle that zeroes the "
"perpendicular component of one run's delta-psi (**143.37 deg**). Solving "
"the 2x2 fit at each separates them without appealing to any of them: "
"cross term **2.0 % at 148.47**, **22.4 % at 143.37**, **38.2 % at "
"-90.00**. So the flux-vector axis is the consistent one, and the "
"\"minimise the perpendicular component\" scan -- which *defines* its own "
"answer -- is circular and is recorded as such rather than used."
msgstr ""
"有意思的地方是 **d 轴不再是一个被假定的量，而成了一个可检验的量** 。当时"
"存在三个候选定义：空载磁链矢量（ **148.47 deg** ）、气隙磁场 4 次谐波的"
"相位（ **-90.00 deg** ），以及把某次运行 delta-psi 的垂直分量归零的角度"
"（ **143.37 deg** ）。在每一个上求解 2x2 拟合就把它们分开，而不必诉诸其"
"中任何一个：交叉项 **2.0 % 在 148.47** 、 **22.4 % 在 143.37** 、 **38.2"
"% 在-90.00** 。所以磁链矢量那条轴是自洽的那一个，而“最小化垂直分量”的扫"
"描——它 *定义* 自己的答案——是循环论证，被记录而不是被使用。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2510 32ad568fa58445bdad44f2dd3b25905a
msgid ""
"**What this is not**: the fit residual is **7.0 %**, so the linear "
"symmetric 2x2 does not fully describe the two points. The likely cause is"
" stated rather than tuned away -- `delta-psi` subtracts the no-load flux "
"as if the magnet's operating point were unchanged, and saturation "
"violates exactly that. So the numbers are recorded with the 7 % attached,"
" **no claim in README moves** (this is `IPMSM_A`, not this kernel's "
"machine), and a third operating point is what would separate cross-"
"saturation from the subtraction error."
msgstr ""
"**这不是什么** ：拟合残差是 **7.0 %** ，所以线性对称 2x2 并未完全描述这"
"两个点。可能的原因被陈述而不是被调着修掉—— `delta-psi` 减去空载磁通，就"
"好像磁体工作点没变，而饱和违反的正是这一点。因此这些数字连着 7 % 一起记"
"录， **README 里没有任何主张移动** （这是 `IPMSM_A` ，不是本内核的机器）"
"，而能把交叉饱和与相减误差分开的是一个第三个工作点。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2517 68b262c278cc473aa7f82849d1e5bb1e
msgid "F-89"
msgstr ""
"F-89"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2519 61acb25b39564d53a970e47ec3097ee1
msgid ""
"A relaunch of the q-axis differential case returned **`exit=0` and "
"produced no artefacts at all**. The cause was outside the model: the "
"machine had rebooted, `/tmp` was cleared, and **Xvfb on `:82` was never "
"restarted**, so wine logged `nodrv_CreateWindow ... Make sure your X "
"server is running and that $DISPLAY is set correctly` and exited "
"successfully without solving. The first attempt had also been killed by "
"that same reboot, but that one left a `.fem` behind, so the two failures "
"looked different when neither had run."
msgstr ""
"重新启动 q 轴差分 case，返回 **`exit=0` 并且一个产物都没有** 。原因在模"
"型之外：那台机器重启过， `/tmp` 被清空，而 **`:82` 上的 Xvfb 从未重启** "
"，于是 wine 记下 `nodrv_CreateWindow ... Make sure your X server "
"isrunningand that $DISPLAY is set correctly` 并成功退出、没有解算。第一"
"次尝试也是被同一次重启杀掉的，但那一次留下了一个 `.fem` ，所以两次都没有"
"跑起来，看起来却不一样。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2524 9fb39e42d9584fe79e007205be41d2d3
msgid ""
"The judgement rule that caught it, and that should have been used from "
"the start: **decide from the artefact, not from the exit code and not "
"from the job/status file**. `nohup` survives SIGHUP and does not survive "
"a reboot; `/tmp` does not survive one either, so a missing status file "
"says nothing. A `.ans` with a fresh timestamp is the only thing that says"
" the solver ran."
msgstr ""
"抓住它的那条判定规则，也是从一开始就该用的： **按产物判定，不按退出码，"
"也不按 job/status 文件判定** 。 `nohup` 能挺过 SIGHUP，挺不过重启； `"
"/tmp` 同样挺不过，所以缺一个状态文件说明不了什么。时间戳新鲜的 `.ans` 才"
"是唯一能说明求解器跑过的东西。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2528 ea99af62dea44c708c41bc4e1a3b20d0
msgid ""
"Same family as F-81/F-83/F-84 and the `automesh`/`-lua-var` cases in C-73"
" -- an accepted invocation that does nothing still exits 0 -- with one "
"difference worth naming: those were inside one process, this one is the "
"harness around it, so the guard belongs in the launcher. The session's "
"own raw `nohup wine` invocations skipped the `preflight()` that "
"`run_ipmsm.py` already has; that check should be the only way to start a "
"solve, or the next reboot will cost another day."
msgstr ""
"与 F-81/F-83/F-84 以及 C-73 里 `automesh` /`-lua-var` 那几个 case 同族——"
"一次被接受却什么都不做的调用照样以 0 退出——有一处差别值得点名：那些都在"
"一个进程内部，这一个在其外部的包壳，所以守卫该放在启动器里。本次会话里直"
"接用 `nohup wine` 的那些调用绕过了 `run_ipmsm.py` 早已有的 `preflight()`"
" ；那次检查应当是启动一次解算的唯一方式，否则下一次重启还要再花一天。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2535 da188940d5774f51b92b11c1f321fea9
msgid "F-90"
msgstr ""
"F-90"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2537 3befbf245a8e4c5da85b1462f2a548e0
msgid ""
"Built the cheap pre-flight the session had been missing "
"(`workspace/tools/geom/smoke.py`, three tiers), measured it, and **proved"
" it can fail**: with Xvfb stopped it returns red in **0.1 s** naming "
"`Xvfb: no Xvfb process`, and with the display back it is green in **4.5 "
"s**. Tiers 0+1+2 cost **3.1 s** together, versus the 44 minutes a real "
"solve costs."
msgstr ""
"把本次会话一直缺的那个便宜的预检建了起来（ `"
"workspace/tools/geom/smoke.py` ，三层），测量了它，并 **证明它会失败** "
"：停掉 Xvfb 时它在 **0.1 s** 内返回红色并指名 `Xvfb: no Xvfb process` ，"
"恢复显示后它在 **4.5 s** 内为绿。第 0+1+2 层合计花 **3.1 s** ，而一次真"
"实解算要花 44 分钟。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2541 e339fdb352344251b33d796e29742c64
msgid ""
"The tier split is forced, not chosen: **a full-machine solve cannot be "
"made cheap** -- a *linear* full solve is 6m22 measured, and scaling the "
"gap mesh up makes the mesher *slower* (it has to fit 30-degree triangles "
"into a 0.75 mm sliver), so my first attempt at a \"coarse everything\" "
"smoke ran into the same 120 s timeout it was supposed to prevent. The "
"answer is three gates: 0 preconditions (<0.1 s), 1 solver path against "
"the coaxial closed form (2.9 s), 2 static assertions on the generated "
"script (0.3 s), and only then 3 a coarse solve with its own budget."
msgstr ""
"分层是被迫的，不是选的： **整机解算无法做得便宜** ——一次 *线性* 整机解算"
"实测6m22，而把气隙网格放大让网格生成器 *更慢* （它得把 30 度的三角形塞进"
"0.75mm 的窄缝），所以我第一次“全部粗化”的 smoke 撞上了它本该防住的同一个"
"120s 超时。答案是三道门：0 前置条件（<0.1 s）、1 对照同轴闭式的求解器路"
"径（2.9 s）、2 对生成脚本的静态断言（0.3 s），之后才 3 一次带自己预算的"
"粗解算。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2547 6b1fffa2283443a5923e8b3257a295be
msgid ""
"**Regression found while doing it**: the sector model, which used to "
"build and solve in 5 s (A-78), now hangs -- 150 s with 2.4 s of CPU and "
"no artefacts. The prime suspect is the six-signed-circuit change (F-84): "
"a 45-degree wedge may leave one of the six circuits with no blocks, which"
" FEMM reports as a modal dialog and `-windowhide` makes invisible. Not "
"investigated yet; recorded so the sector path is not believed to be one "
"flag away."
msgstr ""
"**做这件事时发现的回归** ：扇区模型以前 5 s 就能建好并解出（A-78），现在"
"卡住了——150 s、2.4 s CPU、没有产物。头号嫌疑是六条带符号电路那处改动（"
"F-84）：一个 45 度的楔形可能让六条电路中的某一条没有任何块，FEMM 把它报"
"成模态对话框，而 `-windowhide` 让它不可见。尚未调查；记录下来，以免有人"
"以为扇区那条路只差一个开关。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2554 2d48d3f1b20f44d2b32919e0bd6ad8f5
msgid "A-91"
msgstr ""
"A-91"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2556 9c9f79280ad24fdaab0764033b037cde
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Ld and Lq are measured, and by the route that needs no assumption about"
" the magnet.** The differential inductance between two loaded points "
"cancels the magnet flux in the subtraction, so nothing depends on \"the "
"magnet's operating point is unchanged\" -- which saturation violates and "
"which was the suspect behind the earlier residual. Result: **Ld(50->100 "
"A) = 0.1899 mH, Lq(50->100 A) = 0.6406 mH, Lq/Ld = 3.37**, with the no-"
"load-subtracted values (0.1932 / 0.6493) agreeing to **1.7 % and 1.4 %** "
"-- both inside the 2 % criterion written before the runs."
msgstr ""
"**Ld 与 Lq 被测到了，而且走的是不需要对磁体做任何假设的那条路线。** 两个"
"带载点之间的差分电感在相减中把磁体磁通抵消，于是没有任何东西依赖“磁体工"
"作点不变”——饱和违反的正是那一点，而它也是早先那个残差的嫌疑。结果： **Ld"
"(50->100 A) = 0.1899 mH、Lq(50->100 A) = 0.6406 mH、Lq/Ld = 3.37** ，而"
"减去空载的值（0.1932 / 0.6493）吻合到 **1.7 % 与 1.4 %** ——两者都在运行"
"之前写下的 2 % 判据之内。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2562 bb6a96eff4fc4973847c243a7f77cb98
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The agreement is the actual content of this row, not the numbers: it says"
" the 7 % residual in A-88 was **not** caused by the magnet-flux "
"subtraction, because removing that subtraction entirely leaves the same "
"values. The joint symmetric 2x2 over all four points gives `Ldq = -0.0041"
" mH`, i.e. **2.1 %** of Ldd, and a residual of **1.37e-03 Wb-turns** -- "
"which is twelve times the d-axis-only residual, so what the "
"constant-`Ldq` model cannot describe is the cross structure, not either "
"axis. Stated as a limit of the extraction, not tuned away."
msgstr ""
"这一行的实际内容是那个吻合，而不是那些数字：它说明 A-88 里 7 % 的残差 **"
"不是** 磁体磁通相减造成的，因为完全去掉那次相减得到的仍是同样的值。对全"
"部四个点做联合对称 2x2 拟合给出 `Ldq = -0.0041 mH` ，即 Ldd 的 **2.1 %**"
" ，残差 **1.37e-03 Wb-turns** ——是只用 d 轴时残差的十二倍，所以常数 `Ldq"
"` 模型描述不了的是交叉结构，而不是哪一条轴。这一点作为提取方法的限度被陈"
"述，没有被调着修掉。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2568 fcab17aba2ee48f295753e541a77d498
msgid ""
"Anchors: published figures for this machine (Toyota Prius 2004, 48 slots,"
" 8 poles) are `Ld` about 0.24 mH and `Lq` about 0.47 mH at rated current."
" Ours is lower on d and higher on q at 100 A, which is what a different "
"operating point would do -- so this is an **anchor, not a validation**, "
"and no claim in README moves: this is `IPMSM_A`, not this kernel's "
"machine."
msgstr ""
"锚点：这台机器（2004 款丰田 Prius，48 槽，8 极）已发表的数据是额定电流下"
" `Ld` 约 0.24 mH、 `Lq` 约 0.47 mH。本项目的值在 100 A 下 d 轴偏低、q 轴"
"偏高，这正是不同工作点会做的事——所以这是一个 **锚点，不是验证** ，README"
"里没有任何主张移动：这是 `IPMSM_A` ，不是本内核的机器。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2574 8b96cb422e39463b932d6a78cda2b5ee
msgid "A-92"
msgstr ""
"A-92"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2576 d5ee7c2b14ce4e5eb669203f0e6f43f6
msgid ""
"**Four-point sweep done (2 h 56 min total, four nonlinear solves at "
"50/100/150/200 A on both axes): both inductances fall monotonically, "
"which was criterion 2 written before the runs.** Differential **Ld = "
"0.1899 / 0.1772 / 0.1645 mH** and **Lq = 0.6406 / 0.6209 / 0.5890 mH** "
"over 50-to-100, 100-to-150 and 150-to-200 A; the no-load-subtracted "
"secants fall too (Ld 0.1955/0.1927/0.1875/0.1818, Lq "
"0.6552/0.6479/0.6389/0.6264). End to end Ld drops **13.4 %** and Lq **8.1"
" %**."
msgstr ""
"**四点扫描完成（共 2 h 56 min，两条轴上 50/100/150/200 A 的四个非线性解"
"算）：两个电感都单调下降，这是运行之前写下的判据 2。** 差分 **Ld ="
"0.1899/ 0.1772 / 0.1645 mH** 与 **Lq = 0.6406 / 0.6209 / 0.5890 mH** ，"
"对应 50到 100、100 到 150、150 到 200 A；减空载的割线也下降（"
"Ld0.1955/0.1927/0.1875/0.1818，Lq 0.6552/0.6479/0.6389/0.6264）。端到端"
"Ld降 **13.4 %** 、Lq 降 **8.1 %** 。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2581 f4435ac8ec584aa28a75ad9236757624
msgid ""
"**The non-obvious result is that the saliency ratio rises with load, not "
"falls: Lq/Ld goes 3.373 to 3.581, +6.1 %.** The prediction I would have "
"written (Lq sags faster than Ld, so MTPA gain shrinks with current) is "
"**wrong for this machine**: Ld saturates faster, so the machine becomes "
"*more* salient under load. That matters for C8 because `MtpaReference` "
"currently carries a single `Lq/Ld = 2`; the direction of its error with "
"load is now known rather than assumed."
msgstr ""
"**不显然的那个结果是：凸极比随负载上升而不是下降：Lq/Ld 从 3.373 走到"
"3.581，+6.1 %。** 我本会写下的预测（Lq 比 Ld 塌得更快，所以 MTPA 增益随"
"电流缩小） **对这台机器是错的** ：Ld 饱和得更快，于是这台机器在负载下变"
"得 *更* 凸极。这对 C8 有影响，因为 `MtpaReference` 目前只带一个 `Lq/Ld ="
"2` ；它的误差随负载往哪个方向走，现在是已知的而不是假定的。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2586 ad02e415304e4f58a937db63470bf44f
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**The number that matters for a torque map is the cost of a single-point "
"parameter set**: using the 50-100 A values across the whole 4x range is "
"**13.4 % high on Ld and 8.1 % high on Lq at 200 A**. Honest scope on "
"criterion 1: the \"two routes agree within 2 %\" check was defined at 100"
" A, where it held at 1.7 %/1.4 %. At 200 A the secant and the chord "
"*must* diverge because saturation is real -- that divergence is the "
"measurement, not a criterion failure, and it is stated rather than re-"
"badged. The global constant-`Ldq` fit also degrades with range (residual "
"1.37e-3 to **2.99e-3** Wb-turns from four to eight points), so `Ldq/Ldd` "
"about 1.5 % is a **bound over the range, not a per-current value**."
msgstr ""
"**对一张转矩表来说要紧的数字，是单点参数集的代价** ：把 50-100 A 的值用"
"在整个 4 倍范围上，在 200 A 处 **Ld 偏高 13.4 %、Lq 偏高 8.1 %** 。关于"
"判据1 的诚实范围：“两条路线在 2 % 内吻合”那次检查是在 100 A 处定义的，那"
"里的读数是 1.7 %/1.4 %。在 200 A 处割线与弦 *必然* 分开，因为饱和是真的—"
"—那处分歧是测量本身，不是判据失败，它被陈述而不是被重新包装。全局常数 `"
"Ldq` 拟合也随范围退化（残差从四点时的 1.37e-3 到八点时的 **2.99e-3** "
"Wb-turns），所以 `Ldq/Ldd` 约 1.5 % 是一个 **覆盖整个范围的界，不是逐电"
"流的值** 。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2595 9b8c781dc42f4435858dfcc99b95020e
msgid "F-93"
msgstr ""
"F-93"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2597 4c4a2686b46d40fdaeeaba3a02912a67
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**The entire evidence chain had no external truth in it.** Every number "
"from A-78 through A-92 came out of one pipeline: the same geometry, the "
"same B-H curve, the same magnet grade, the same mesher. A-87 had already "
"proved that two such routes agreeing to 0.1 % is not evidence of "
"correctness but of a shared assumption -- and nothing in the plan's "
"third-layer leg was positioned to detect that."
msgstr ""
"**整条证据链里没有外部真值。** 从 A-78 到 A-92 的每个数字都出自同一条流"
"水线：同一几何、同一条 B-H 曲线、同一档磁体、同一个网格生成器。A-87 已经"
"证明，这样两条路线吻合到 0.1 % 并不证明正确，只证明共用了一条假设——而计"
"划第三层那一支上没有任何东西处在能发现这一点的位置。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2601 6054c04a035049848ef7fb06edeaa58c
msgid ""
"Surfaced while answering a question about whether *public* motor data "
"exists, on the theory that the answer would be no and the geometry leg "
"would be closed. It is yes: the U.S. Department of Energy had this exact "
"motor torn down and instrumented at Oak Ridge National Laboratory, and "
"both reports are public with stable DOIs -- ORNL/TM-2006/423 "
"(`doi:10.2172/947571`, measured electrical and thermal characteristics) "
"and ORNL/TM-2004/137 (`doi:10.2172/885676`, design and manufacturing "
"assessment). `IPMSM_A` *is* the 2004 Toyota Prius traction motor, so the "
"measurement is of the same physical machine that the geometry describes, "
"and no datasheet -- and no domain knowledge -- is required from anyone to"
" use it."
msgstr ""
"它是在回答“是否存在 *公开* 的电机数据”这个问题时浮出来的，当时的设想是答"
"案为否、几何那一支就此收口。答案是肯定的：美国能源部在橡树岭国家实验室把"
"这台电机拆开并布了仪表，两份报告都是公开的，DOI 稳定——ORNL/TM-2006/423（"
" `doi:10.2172/947571` ，实测的电气与热特性）与 ORNL/TM-2004/137（ `"
"doi:10.2172/885676` ，设计与制造评估）。 `IPMSM_A` *就是* 2004 款丰田"
"Prius的牵引电机，所以那份测量针对的正是这个几何所描述的实体机器，而使用"
"它不需要任何人去查数据手册，也不需要领域知识。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2609 4f97a29028164f2595ada2ad6c0c5498
msgid ""
"The consequence is that the distinction the third layer was built to make"
" was never being made: the project could say \"our `psi_f` is 0.18826 Wb,"
" confirmed twice\" and had no way to say whether 0.18826 was *right*. "
"Blast radius is the honesty of every earlier row, not any one number. No "
"claim row moves on this row alone -- it is the defect, not the repair; "
"the repair is A-93."
msgstr ""
"后果是：建起第三层正是为了做出那个区分，而它从未被做出——项目可以说“本项"
"目的 `psi_f` 是 0.18826 Wb，确认过两次”，却没有办法说 0.18826 是否 *正确"
"* 。影响范围是此前每一行的诚实性，而不是某一个数字。单凭这一行，没有任何"
"主张行移动——它是缺陷，不是修复；修复是 A-93。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2615 24d089eaf4684a05a253a30945c6565d
msgid "A-93"
msgstr ""
"A-93"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2617 1be85e7dd0534cd39c55e10ad6d0cad0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**First comparison against third-party measurement in this project, and "
"it says our `psi_f` is 8.9 % high.** ORNL/TM-2006/423 Table 6.2 states "
"the measured motor voltage constant as **1.33 Vrms/Hz** (terminal, line-"
"to-line), which converts to **`psi_f` = 0.17283 Wb** for a four-pole-pair"
" machine. Ours is 0.18826 Wb, i.e. **+8.93 %**."
msgstr ""
"**本项目第一次与第三方测量做对照，而它说本项目的 `psi_f` 高了 8.9 %。** "
"ORNL/TM-2006/423 表 6.2 给出实测的电机电压常数为 **1.33 Vrms/Hz** （端电"
"压，线电压），对一台四对极机器折算成 **`psi_f` = 0.17283 Wb** 。本项目的"
"是 0.18826 Wb，即 **+8.93 %** 。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2621 0757056389bd4f4895ed6553989b238a
msgid ""
"**The source was made trustworthy before it was used.** Four independent "
"checks on the transcription: `f_e/(rpm/60)` over the twelve Table 3.4 "
"points lands in [3.942, 4.040] against the known 4 pole pairs; the least-"
"squares slope through the origin is 1.3481 V/Hz against the report's own "
"stated 1.33 (+1.36 %); the fit predicts 539.2 Vrms at 400 Hz against "
"Table 6.2's 540 Vrms at 6000 rpm (+0.14 %); and Vpeak/Vrms over the "
"twelve points lands in [1.540, 1.786], every one of them above "
"``sqrt(2)``, so the rms and peak columns are demonstrably not confused. "
"All four are asserted in `workspace/tools/geom/oracle_ornl.py`, which "
"refuses to print a comparison if any of them fails, and `--selftest` "
"detunes `psi_f` by 1.30x and 0.70x and requires both to go red."
msgstr ""
"**来源在被动用之前先被做成可信的。** 对这份转录做了四项独立检查：表 3.4"
"那十二个点上的 `f_e/(rpm/60)` 落在 [3.942, 4.040]，对照已知的 4 对极；过"
"原点的最小二乘斜率是 1.3481 V/Hz，对照报告自己写下的 1.33（+1.36 %）；拟"
"合预测 400 Hz 时 539.2 Vrms，对照表 6.2 在 6000 rpm 的 540 Vrms（+0.14 %"
"）；十二个点上的 Vpeak/Vrms 落在 [1.540, 1.786]，每一个都在 ``sqrt(2)`` "
"之上，所以 rms 列与峰值列显然没有弄混。四项都断言在 `"
"workspace/tools/geom/oracle_ornl.py` 里，任何一项失败它就拒绝打印对照，"
"而 `--selftest` 把 `psi_f` 分别调偏 1.30x 与 0.70x，并要求两者都变红。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2629 d9c0df5ee7f64d719563f5047ec1e978
msgid ""
"**The ``+-10 %`` band was chosen after the number was seen, and is "
"recorded as such.** It is a statement of measured accuracy, not a pre-"
"registered prediction -- the one prediction that *was* pre-registered "
"(0.35 to 0.40 Wb) was falsified in A-87 and stays falsified. Against the "
"band the comparison passes at 10 % and fails at 5 %. The confounders "
"named here are the ones that no amount of further meshing or further "
"angle points can remove: a 2D solve has no end-region leakage and so "
"reads high, the geometry is a reconstruction and not Toyota's drawing, "
"the B-H is an assumed M400-50A grade, and the magnet is `Br` = 1.1906 T "
"from the vendor `Hc`. **That is the reason deepening the FEMM leg further"
" now has low marginal value**: the residual is dominated by terms a finer"
" discretisation cannot reach, so the next useful move is upstream and "
"downstream of the field solve, not inside it. No claim row is promoted: "
"this is `IPMSM_A`, README is untouched, and what changed is that this "
"project can now state an error bar instead of an agreement between two of"
" its own calculations."
msgstr ""
"**``+-10 %`` 这条带是在看到数字之后才选的，并如实记录。** 它是一句关于实"
"测精度的陈述，不是预先登记的预测——唯一 *曾* 预先登记的那条预测（0.35 到"
"0.40 Wb）在 A-87 被否证，现在依然被否证。对照这条带，比较在 10 % 处通过"
"、在 5 % 处失败。此处点名的混杂因素，是再多的网格细化或再多的角度点都去"
"不掉的几种：2D 解没有端部漏磁，所以读数偏高；几何是一次重建，不是丰田的"
"图纸；B-H 是按 M400-50A 这一档假定的；磁体的 `Br` = 1.1906 T 是由厂商 `"
"Hc` 推出来的。 **这就是现在继续加深 FEMM 那一支边际价值很低的原因** ：残"
"差由更细的离散化够不到的项主导，所以下一个有用的动作在那次磁场解算的上游"
"与下游，而不在它内部。没有主张行被提升：这是 `IPMSM_A` ，README 未动，改"
"变的是这个项目现在能给出一个误差带，而不是它自己两次计算之间的吻合。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2642 fd4c1472bd40408c9bdf18cf2f56e7a5
msgid "F-94"
msgstr ""
"F-94"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2644 cd075f44bef64f78b057bb1a6409c7c7
msgid ""
"**A \"5 % band\" that read like an accuracy statement about a motor and "
"was in fact an accuracy statement about arithmetic.** `torque_map` "
"converts a nameplate it is *handed*; nothing in the claim said so, and "
"the L2 evidence could not have discovered it -- the mechanics comparison "
"perturbs the map while the SIL plant keeps the true constants, so a "
"nameplate error is structurally invisible to that test. The same "
"blindness sits inside the existing falsifier: scaling the map's gain by "
"0.9 moves the measurement to -9.994 %, which measures the code against a "
"plant that is right, not the map against a machine that might not be."
msgstr ""
"**一条“5 % 带宽”读起来像关于一台电机的精度陈述，实际上是一句关于算术的精"
"度陈述。** `torque_map` 转换的是 *被交给它* 的铭牌；主张里没有一个字说明"
"这一点，而 L2 的证据也不可能发现它——力学对照扰动的是那张表，而 SIL 被控"
"对象保持真实常数，所以铭牌误差对那次测试在结构上不可见。同一种盲区也在既"
"有的否证器里：把表的增益乘 0.9，测量移到 -9.994 %，那是在拿代码对照一个"
"正确的被控对象，而不是拿那张表对照一台可能并非如此的机器。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2651 3166f3796663480e913a7739a2ce3d03
msgid ""
"Surfaced by writing the L3 sensitivity leg, which is required to use "
"error bars the project has **measured** rather than invented ones. There "
"are now two: the externally measured `psi_f` deviation of **+8.93 %** "
"(A-93, against the ORNL bench data) and the **13.4 % / 8.1 %** `Ld`/`Lq` "
"saturation between a 50-100 A nameplate and a 200 A operating point "
"(A-92). Propagating the first one alone moves the torque estimate "
"**+9.749 %** -- above the map's own 5 % band."
msgstr ""
"它是在写 L3 敏感度那一支时浮出来的，而那一支被要求使用项目 **实测** 的误"
"差带，而不是编出来的。现在有两条：外部实测的 `psi_f` 偏差 **+8.93 %** （"
"A-93，对照 ORNL 台架数据），以及 50-100 A 铭牌与 200 A 工作点之间 `Ld` /"
"`Lq` 的 **13.4 % / 8.1 %** 饱和（A-92）。只传播第一条，转矩估计就移动 **"
"+9.749 %** ——超出那张表自己的 5 % 带宽。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2656 6b0ed9a2050743528d4af40460c69c52
msgid ""
"Blast radius is the claim text only; no implementation change. It also "
"explains why the earlier numbers looked so good: +0.006 % agreement is a "
"statement that the code computes what it says, and this project had been "
"reporting it in a column where readers expect a statement about a "
"machine. The repair is A-95."
msgstr ""
"影响范围只在主张的文字里；实现没有改动。它也解释了为什么先前的数字看起来"
"那么好：+0.006 % 的吻合是一句“代码算出了它自己说的那个东西”的陈述，而这"
"个项目一直把它报在一列里，而读那一列的人期待的是关于一台机器的陈述。修复"
"是 A-95。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2662 dcba5b4916fd4e2287297df647e36029
msgid "A-95"
msgstr ""
"A-95"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2664 0e34343d5d8d4383abf16c352ccdecbb
msgid ""
"**`torque_map`'s L3 evidence is complete, and the level is held at L2 "
"anyway, because the repository's own suite is red (F-96).** The evidence "
"is at least as much about what the level does *not* buy as about what it "
"does. Sensitivity on measured bars: `psi_f` +8.93 % moves the estimate "
"**+9.749 %** (amplified, because the reluctance term subtracts at that "
"working point -- a `kt` error cannot be damped there), `Ld` -13.4 % moves"
" it **-1.229 %**, `Lq` -8.1 % moves it **+1.486 %**, and all three "
"together **+10.006 %**."
msgstr ""
"**`torque_map` 的 L3 证据是齐的，而层级仍保持在 L2，因为仓库自己的套件是"
"红的（F-96）。** 这些证据关于这个层级 *没有* 换来什么，至少与关于它换来"
"了什么一样多。基于实测误差带的敏感度： `psi_f` +8.93 % 使估计移动 **+"
"9.749 %** （被放大，因为该工作点上磁阻项是相减的—— `kt` 的误差在那里压不"
"住）， `Ld` -13.4 % 使它移动 **-1.229 %** ， `Lq` -8.1 % 使它移动 **+"
"1.486 %** ，三者一起 **+10.006 %** 。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2670 9aa08d06f84a41dca7ce715fdff2e64b
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Phase-variable witness, reused from the `test_abc_plant.cpp` six-point "
"recipe: the co-energy model, which never forms a d-q quantity and never "
"uses `kt`, agrees with `torque_estimate` to **0.001 %** at six `id = 0` "
"points (0/200/800 rad/s electrical x 1/2 A) against a 2 % criterion. A "
"falsifier runs the same comparison against a map whose gain is 10 % low "
"and reads **0.900000**, so the witness is proved able to reject an error "
"of the size it claims to detect."
msgstr ""
"相变量证人，复用 `test_abc_plant.cpp` 的六点配方：共能模型从不构造任何"
"d-q 量、也从不使用 `kt` ，它在六个 `id = 0` 点（0/200/800 rad/s 电角度乘"
"1/2 A）上与 `torque_estimate` 吻合到 **0.001 %** ，判据是 2 %。一个否证"
"器对增益低 10 % 的表跑同样的对照，读到 **0.900000** ，所以这个证人被证明"
"能够拒掉它所声称能测出的那种大小的误差。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2675 1fdc556c4ac24f19af252e110cc26f71
msgid ""
"**The blind spot is measured rather than asserted away.** `AbcPlant` is "
"non-salient by construction (its own documentation explains why a salient"
" abc model would reintroduce the transform being checked), so it has no "
"reluctance term to disagree with: at `id = +1 A` the two readings differ "
"by **-8.40 %** of the torque, at `id = -1 A` by **+8.40 %**, and that "
"difference is exactly the map's saliency term and nothing else (asserted "
"to 1e-3 relative). So the saliency half of this claim rests on the "
"sensitivity table alone. README says that in the row rather than "
"presenting the cross-check as complete -- and the same convention already"
" governs `reference.hpp`, whose `MtpaReference` saliency claim is "
"likewise L3 through sensitivity, not through a second derivation. No code"
" changed; what was added is evidence and text, and the 5 % band is now "
"explicitly a statement about the code path rather than about a physical "
"motor. **The promotion itself is one edit away and is deliberately not "
"made**: README says L2 and says why, so that the level and the build "
"agree."
msgstr ""
"**盲区是被测量出来的，而不是被断言掉的。** `AbcPlant` 按构造就是非凸极的"
"（它自己的文档解释了为什么一个凸极的 abc 模型会重新引入正在被检查的那个"
"变换），所以它没有可与之不一致的磁阻项：在 `id = +1 A` 处两个读数相差转"
"矩的 **-8.40 %** ，在 `id = -1 A` 处相差 **+8.40 %** ，而这个差值恰是那"
"张表的凸极项，别无其他（断言到 1e-3 相对）。所以这条主张里凸极的那一半仅"
"凭敏感度表支撑。README 在那一行里就是这么说的，而不是把这次交叉检查说成"
"完整的——同一条约定早已管着 `reference.hpp` ，它的 `MtpaReference` 凸极主"
"张同样是靠敏感度成为 L3，而不是靠第二套推导。没有代码改动；增加的是证据"
"与文字，而 5 % 带宽现在明确是一句关于代码路径的陈述，而不是关于一台实体"
"电机的陈述。 **提升本身只差一处编辑，并且是有意不做的** ：README 写的是"
"L2并写了原因，以便层级与构建一致。"

