#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2885 0108939bba72449695cdaf8bd463aae3
msgid "F-104"
msgstr ""
"F-104"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2887 b9d382a5b5114547ac5201b833e7a2ff
msgid ""
"**A case asserted on a floating-point rounding floor, so it failed on the"
" platform where the code did better.** "
"`TheFitIsUnbiasedOnAWindowThatIsNotAWholeNumberOfCycles` carried "
"`ASSERT_GT(part_fit, 0.0F)` -- a guard written only so a ratio could be "
"printed -- where `part_fit` is the fit's own rounding error: **1.2e-07 on"
" Linux, exactly 0.0 on macOS**, because Apple's libm is more accurate. In"
" other words the assertion encoded \"this platform's trig must be at "
"least as inaccurate as glibc's\"."
msgstr ""
"**一个 case 断言在浮点舍入地板上，于是在代码表现更好的平台上失败了。** `"
"TheFitIsUnbiasedOnAWindowThatIsNotAWholeNumberOfCycles` 带着 `ASSERT_GT("
"part_fit, 0.0F)` ——一个只为能打印比值而写的守卫——而 `part_fit` 是拟合自"
"身的舍入误差： **Linux 上 1.2e-07，macOS 上恰好 0.0** ，因为 Apple 的"
"libm更精确。换句话说，那条断言编码的是“这个平台的三角函数至少要和 glibc"
"一样不精确”。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2892 66f8246a797341f39c7a64c807f9d3fb
msgid ""
"Surfaced by the platform matrix, not by review: `Tests / Auto Testing "
"(macos-latest)` reported 605 of 606 passing with that one case failing on"
" `Expected: (part_fit) > (0.0F), actual: 0 vs 0`. The case had been "
"reported green locally for a day, and locally it *is* green -- Linux is "
"the platform where the noise is non-zero. A single-platform pass was "
"never evidence about this assertion."
msgstr ""
"它靠平台矩阵浮出来，不是靠评审： `Tests / Auto Testing (macos-latest)` "
"报告 606 个里 605 个通过，那一个 case 失败在 `Expected: (part_fit) > ("
"0.0F), actual: 0 vs 0` 。那个 case 在本机被报成绿的有一整天，而它在本机*"
"确实* 是绿的——Linux 才是噪声不为零的那个平台。单平台的通过从来不是关于这"
"条断言的证据。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2897 3288d910bb4c4b019631459ce7db3016
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Blast radius is small in files and large in kind: three of the assertions"
" added in this session were comparative (`x > k * y`) where `y` sat at or"
" near a noise floor, and the other two were removed in the same edit "
"before they could fail. Both halves are now **absolute errors against the"
" 1 % line** -- the fit inside it on every window length, the plain DFT "
"bin outside it at 3.20 and 3.40 cycles -- which states the same "
"discrimination without dividing by a platform constant."
msgstr ""
"影响范围在文件上小、在性质上大：本次会话新增的断言里有三条是比较式的（ `"
"x> k * y` ），其中 `y` 就坐在或挨着噪声地板，另外两条在同一次编辑里、还"
"没机会失败就被删掉了。两半现在都是 **对照 1 % 这条线的绝对误差** ——拟合"
"在每个窗长上都在这条线之内，普通 DFT bin 在 3.20 与 3.40 周期处在线外——"
"这表达了同样的分辨力，却不用除以一个平台常数。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2902 0e749e2114f2470ebbcf8b1182a56d18
msgid ""
"The rule this produces: **a tolerance has to be written in the units the "
"claim is about.** \"This fit is exact\" is a statement against a "
"behavioural threshold, not against another estimator's rounding noise; "
"and a quantity *at* the floor has no resolution, so comparing it to "
"anything is comparing nothing. This is the second time a defect has "
"turned out to be the criterion rather than the implementation (the first "
"was A-39, a signed metric measured at a single target), and it is worth "
"noting that both were found by a measurement refusing to agree, not by "
"reading the test."
msgstr ""
"由此得出的规矩： **容差必须写在这条主张所谈论的单位上。** “这个拟合是精"
"确的”是一句对照行为阈值的陈述，而不是对照另一个估计器的舍入噪声；而一个"
"*处在* 地板上的量没有分辨率，把它与任何东西相比都是在比较空无。这是缺陷"
"第二次被查明在判据而不在实现（第一次是 A-39，一条带符号的指标在单个目标"
"点上测量），而值得记下的是两者都是靠一次测量拒绝吻合发现的，不是靠读测试"
"。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2910 1fb6464c18084c28bece35ece23c1fff
msgid "F-105"
msgstr ""
"F-105"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2912 a8a1af755a4c485194686585909efb58
msgid ""
"**A timeout decided on a float sum of control periods, so it fired early "
"and then stopped firing at all.** `HomingRoutine` kept `elapsed_s_ += "
"dt_s` in float and compared it to the recipe's `timeout_s`. A float sum "
"of equal terms does not lose precision slowly -- it changes speed and "
"then freezes: once `ulp(t) > dt/2` each addition advances the sum by an "
"ULP instead of by `dt`, and once `ulp(t) > dt` the addition is a no-op. "
"At a 25 us period the sum read \"512 s\" after **17 866 579** periods, "
"i.e. after **446.664 s** of real time, and could not advance at all past "
"that. So a 512 s recipe gave up 65 s early and a 520 s recipe **never "
"gave up**, which is the exact opposite of what the failure path in that "
"file promises: \"giving up rather than turning forever\". Measured at the"
" freeze point: 512 s at 40 kHz, 2048 s at 10 kHz, 32768 s at 1 kHz -- "
"`2^24*dt` rounded up to a power of two."
msgstr ""
"**一个超时判定建在控制周期的 float 求和上，于是它提前触发，随后完全不再"
"触发。** `HomingRoutine` 把 `elapsed_s_ += dt_s` 保存在 float 里，并与配"
"方的 `timeout_s` 比较。相同项的 float 求和不是缓慢失精——它先变速、然后冻"
"住：一旦 `ulp(t) > dt/2` ，每次加法推进的是一个 ULP 而不是 `dt` ；一旦 `"
"ulp(t) > dt` ，加法就是空操作。在 25 us 周期下，这个和在 **17 866 579** "
"个周期之后读到“512 s”，即真实时间 **446.664 s** 之后，而此后完全无法推进"
"。于是一个 512 s 的配方提前 65 s 放弃，而一个 520 s 的配方 **永不放弃** "
"，这恰与那个文件里失败路径所承诺的相反：“放弃而不是永远转下去”。在冻结点"
"上实测：40 kHz 时 512 s，10 kHz 时 2048 s，1 kHz 时 32768 s—— `2^24*dt` "
"向上取整成二的幂次。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2921 e7bf7d561c574ace88c6f0b20f159bc9
msgid ""
"Surfaced by the L3 work on `core/homing.hpp`: the case that was supposed "
"to show \"the timeout is decided on the sample grid\" printed `446.664 s`"
" where the recipe said 512 s. The number was found by *not* accepting the"
" first explanation -- \"the caller's period is coarse\" -- and instead "
"asking where a sum of equal floats stops being a sum. A test that had "
"only asserted \"the search eventually stops\" would have passed for a "
"year: the freeze only shows up past a magnitude nobody exercises, which "
"is why the 20 M-tick case that found it is now in "
"`test_homing_routine.cpp` and the same sum is mirrored in "
"`test_elapsed_clock.cpp`."
msgstr ""
"它靠 `core/homing.hpp` 上的 L3 工作浮出来：那个本该展示“超时是在采样栅格"
"上判定的”的 case 打印出 `446.664 s` ，而配方说的是 512 s。这个数字是靠 *"
"不* 接受第一个解释——“调用方的周期太粗”——而是去问相同 float 的求和在哪里"
"不再是一个和，才找到的。一个只断言“搜索最终会停”的测试会绿上一年：冻结只"
"在没人跑过的量级之外才露面，这就是找到它的那个 20 M-tick 的 case 现在在 "
"`test_homing_routine.cpp` 里、而同一个和也在 `test_elapsed_clock.cpp` 里"
"被镜像的原因。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2928 824c1d9d2afc48c79a180c6ef850f355
msgid ""
"**The same line was in four more modules** and one more accumulator: "
"`startup.cpp`, `alignment.cpp`, `polarity.cpp`, `stall_start.hpp` (a hold"
" timer) and `stall_start.hpp`'s torque ramp -- the last of which freezes "
"at 4.19 N*m for a gentle 0.01 N*m/s recipe, i.e. *inside* its working "
"range, because there the increment is `ramp*dt` rather than `dt`. Four of"
" the five had limits small enough (milliseconds to a couple of seconds) "
"that the floor was never reachable, which is precisely how a defect "
"survives: not because it is invisible, but because the numbers used in "
"every test sit below it. Finding the first one is what made the other "
"five findable, and fixing only the first would have been the same defect "
"one magnitude away."
msgstr ""
"**同一行还在另外四个模块里** ，另外还有一个累加器： `startup.cpp` 、 `"
"alignment.cpp` 、 `polarity.cpp` 、 `stall_start.hpp` （一个保持计时器）"
"以及 `stall_start.hpp` 的转矩斜坡——最后一个在温和的 0.01 N *m/s 配方下冻"
"结在4.19 N* m，即 *在工作范围之内* ，因为那里的增量是 `ramp*dt` 而不是 `"
"dt` 。五个里有四个的限值足够小（毫秒到两三秒），地板根本够不到，缺陷正是"
"这样活下来的：不是因为它不可见，而是因为每个测试里用的数字都在它下面。找"
"到第一个才使另外五个可找，而只修第一个等于把同一个缺陷挪到一个数量级之外"
"。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2935 c7a6934ca2f04d22bfa59e8cb3373379
msgid ""
"Blast radius, from `gates.py claims --impact core/types.hpp`: **40 claim "
"rows** rest on the header that now carries the clock, so the re-run is "
"the whole core suite plus the SIL cases that own a timeout -- "
"`test_homing_routine.cpp`, `test_sil_homing.cpp`, `test_startup.cpp`, "
"`test_sil_startup.cpp`, `test_alignment.cpp`, `test_polarity.cpp`, "
"`test_stall_start.cpp`, `test_elapsed_clock.cpp`, all green, and the "
"recipe ticks are now what the arithmetic says: 40 000 / 20 480 000 / 20 "
"800 000 for 1 s / 512 s / 520 s at 40 kHz."
msgstr ""
"影响范围，来自 `gates.py claims --impact core/types.hpp` ： **40 条主张"
"行** 压在那个现在承载时钟的头文件上，所以重跑的是整个 core 套件加上拥有"
"超时的那些 SIL case—— `test_homing_routine.cpp` 、 `test_sil_homing.cpp`"
" 、 `test_startup.cpp` 、 `test_sil_startup.cpp` 、 `test_alignment.cpp`"
" 、 `test_polarity.cpp` 、 `test_stall_start.cpp` 、 `"
"test_elapsed_clock.cpp` ，全部为绿，而配方的 tick 数现在是算术说的那样："
"40 kHz 下 1 s / 512 s / 520s 分别为 40 000 / 20 480 000 / 20 800 000。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2942 5bf725accc6b43ee8e0f8f0b97e97ac3
msgid ""
"The rule this produces: **a duration that only grows is never accumulated"
" in float.** It is not a style preference and the fix is not an `if` -- a"
" growing sum of periods has a *speed* proportional to its own magnitude, "
"so it has no valid range that a tolerance can be written against. "
"`gates.py clocks` now scans `include/` and `src/` for a float accumulated"
" with a `dt` term and fails on every one that is not on an allow list "
"carrying its bound (`speed_elapsed_s_`, `position_elapsed_s_`, "
"`stall_elapsed_s_` -- all bounded by construction, all cleared or faulted"
" before their magnitude could matter). Its `--selftest` classifies four "
"snippets, so a classifier that has stopped finding anything cannot pass "
"by finding nothing. The deeper lesson is about the earlier L3 row itself:"
" it **measured** this defect, wrote it into the README as a limitation, "
"and moved on. A measured defect on the boundary of a published claim is "
"not a limitation to record -- it is the claim being wrong, and recording "
"it is what made it look handled."
msgstr ""
"由此得出的规矩： **只会增长的时长永远不用 float 累加。** 这不是风格偏好"
"，修法也不是一个 `if` ——不断增长的周期和，其 *速度* 与自身量级成正比，所"
"以它没有可以写容差的有效范围。 `gates.py clocks` 现在扫描 `include/` 与 "
"`src/` ，找出带 `dt` 项累加的 float，并对每一个不在白名单上的一律失败（"
"白名单带着各自的界： `speed_elapsed_s_` 、 `position_elapsed_s_` 、 `"
"stall_elapsed_s_` ——都是按构造有界的，都在其量级开始要紧之前被清掉或报故"
"障）。它的 `--selftest` 对四个片段做分类，所以一个已经什么都查不出来的分"
"类器无法靠“什么都没找到”通过。更深的教训是关于更早那条 L3 行本身：它 **"
"测到了** 这个缺陷，把它当作一条限制写进 README，然后继续往前走。一条被测"
"量出来的缺陷落在已发布主张的边界上，不是一条该记录下来的限制——而是那条主"
"张本身错了，而把它记录下来恰恰使它看起来已经被处理。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2954 4a221f30c419402cb8fe727299b46a3a
msgid "F-107"
msgstr ""
"F-107"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2956 04ac039d35844028b464aa07f9971456
msgid ""
"**The documented go/no-go rule for field weakening could never return "
"`true`, and the branch that decided it was undocumented.** "
"`is_field_weakening_worthwhile()` promised `worthwhile = ratio < 0.6 && "
"speed_gain >= 1.5`, each half with a rationale. An earlier `if` returns "
"`true` whenever `Ld*i_max >= psi_f` (the current limit can null the "
"flux), so the surviving expression was reached only with `lambda = "
"Ld*i_max/psi_f < 1`, where `ratio = 1/lambda > 1` and `gain = "
"1/(1-lambda) < 1.5` -- i.e. it was **unreachable-as-true**. The "
"function's real rule was one comparison, `i_char <= i_max`, and it was "
"written nowhere."
msgstr ""
"**文档里那条弱磁的 go/no-go 规则永远不可能返回 `true`，而真正做出判定的"
"那个分支没有文档。** `is_field_weakening_worthwhile()` 承诺 `worthwhile="
"ratio < 0.6 && speed_gain >= 1.5` ，每一半都配了理由。更早的一个 `if` 在"
" `Ld*i_max >= psi_f` 时（电流限值足以把磁链抵消）直接返回 `true` ，于是"
"活下来的那个表达式只在 `lambda = Ld*i_max/psi_f < 1` 时被到达，那里 `"
"ratio= 1/lambda > 1` 、 `gain = 1/(1-lambda) < 1.5` ——也就是说它 **不可"
"能为真** 。这个函数真正的规则是一次比较， `i_char <= i_max` ，而它没有写"
"在任何地方。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2962 9f0b301489464f79903ea2fe45e0a8ae
msgid ""
"Surfaced by turning the advice into a selection table and asserting each "
"verdict against the *documented* rule recomputed from the same nameplate."
" Four of five rows agreed -- they are all far below the line, where both "
"readings say no -- and the disagreement only appears in `1 <= lambda < "
"5/3`, a band no real machine in the collection occupies. That is the "
"shape of the defect worth remembering: **two pieces of code agreed on "
"every input anyone had tried, because every input was far from the "
"boundary.**"
msgstr ""
"它靠把这条建议做成一张选择表、并把每个判定对照用同一份铭牌重算的 *文档化"
"* 规则来断言，才浮出来。五行里有四行一致——它们都远在这条线之下，两种读法"
"都说否——分歧只出现在 `1 <= lambda < 5/3` ，而集合里没有任何真实机器落在"
"这个带里。这才是值得记住的缺陷形状： **两段代码在任何人试过的每个输入上"
"都一致，因为每个输入都远离那条边界。**"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2967 02d6435c402f44128810e1e154a439bb
msgid ""
"Blast radius: the verdict is exposed to C as "
"`foc_field_weakening_worthwhile`, so the documentation of a public answer"
" was wrong for a whole band of machines. No behaviour changed -- the "
"code's answer (a step at `i_char = i_max`) is the defensible one, since "
"below the line the flux cannot be nulled at all, and the docstring's own "
"rationale (\"the region is a sliver\") describes exactly that. The fix is"
" to the header: the rule is now stated as the one comparison, the two "
"dead thresholds are removed, and `test_field_weakening.cpp` pins the step"
" at `lambda = 1` (bisected to 1e-5) and asserts that neither old "
"threshold could ever have decided. Re-run: `test_field_weakening.cpp`, "
"`test_field_weakening_motor.cpp`, `test_api_c_smoke.cpp`, all green."
msgstr ""
"影响范围：这个判定以 `foc_field_weakening_worthwhile` 对 C 暴露，所以一"
"个公开答案的文档对整整一个机器带都是错的。行为没有改变——代码给出的答案（"
"在 `i_char = i_max` 处一个阶跃）是站得住的那个，因为在这条线以下磁链根本"
"抵消不了，而 docstring 自己的理由（“那个区域是一条窄缝”）描述的正是这一"
"点。修复在头文件：规则现在写成那一次比较，两个死掉的阈值被删除， `"
"test_field_weakening.cpp` 把阶跃钉在 `lambda = 1` （二分到 1e-5），并断"
"言两个旧阈值都不可能做出过判定。重跑： `test_field_weakening.cpp` 、 `"
"test_field_weakening_motor.cpp` 、 `test_api_c_smoke.cpp` ，全部为绿。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2975 308b27a53e8a4bbfbb464f45fd2a690b
msgid ""
"The rule this produces: **a threshold that cannot bind is not a policy, "
"it is decoration.** When two conditions are written in series, prove that"
" each one can be the deciding test -- otherwise remove it and say what "
"the remaining one means. And the corollary that made it invisible for so "
"long: a shipped advisory should be run over **every machine you have "
"parameters for**, not just the one on the bench."
msgstr ""
"由此得出的规矩： **一个不可能生效的阈值不是策略，是装饰。** 当两个条件串"
"联写着时，要证明每一个都能成为决定性的那一次检验——否则删掉它，并说明剩下"
"的那个意味着什么。还有一条推论，正是它让这件事这么久不可见：一个随发行版"
"发出的建议应当在 **你有参数的每一台机器上** 跑过，而不只是台架上那一台。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2981 ba5d7f28227745b7ab1536193535e95b
msgid "F-108"
msgstr ""
"F-108"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2983 a14efdd7a85a4c4f874c37e49e0f0cb3
msgid ""
"**The mode machine's documented transition rule omitted two of its seven "
"edges, and the two it omitted are the aborts.** `sm.hpp` said \"Idle -> "
"Align -> Run, any state -> Fault, Fault -> Idle on an explicit clear\". "
"Measured, `Align -> Idle` and `Run -> Idle` are legal as well -- the "
"table has seven edges, not five -- so the sentence told a reader that a "
"running motor **cannot be commanded back to Idle**. A caller obeying the "
"documentation would have had to fault the drive in order to stop it."
msgstr ""
"**模式机的文档化转移规则漏掉了它七条边中的两条，而漏掉的正是那两条中止边"
"。** `sm.hpp` 写着“Idle -> Align -> Run，任意状态 -> Fault，Fault ->"
"Idle需显式清除”。实测 `Align -> Idle` 与 `Run -> Idle` 同样合法——表里有"
"七条边，不是五条——所以那句话告诉读者，一台运行中的电机 **无法被命令回到"
"Idle** 。照文档行事的调用方为了停机，只能把驱动器打到故障。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2988 e882a5cc539e483fbf7e251ee87559fd
msgid ""
"Surfaced by measuring the machine as a **graph** instead of as a table of"
" cells: enumerating the relation on the code (four start states x four "
"targets) gives out-degree `2 / 3 / 2 / 0` and in-degree `2 / 1 / 1 / 3`, "
"and the seven edges only balance against the documentation if the two "
"aborts exist. The cell-by-cell test that was already there could not "
"catch it: it compared the table against a *copy of the table*, which is "
"exactly the shape of check that cannot notice a sentence disagreeing with"
" both."
msgstr ""
"它靠把这台机器当成一个 **图** 而不是一张格子表来测量才浮出来：在代码上枚"
"举这个关系（四个起始状态乘四个目标）给出出度 `2 / 3 / 2 / 0` 、入度 `2 /"
"1/ 1 / 3` ，而那七条边只有在两条中止边存在时才与文档相称。原先就有的逐格"
"测试抓不住它：它拿表与 *表的一份副本* 比，而那恰是察觉不到“一句话与两者"
"都不符”的那种检查形状。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:2993 5974901b8d6a4a1eb8c6b3b1c20a867d
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Blast radius: the class documentation of a safety-subset module, and any "
"caller that planned a stop. No code changed -- the behaviour is right and"
" the abort is the useful edge. `test_sm.cpp` now enumerates the relation "
"and computes the graph properties over it (every state reachable from "
"`Idle`, `Fault` the only sink, no self-loop through `request()`), so the "
"sentence is no longer load-bearing; the header states the seven edges and"
" names the one thing that is easy to get wrong in the other direction "
"(**`request(current)` is a refusal, not a no-op**, so a supervisor that "
"re-asserts its target every cycle fills `illegal_transitions()`). Re-run:"
" `test_sm.cpp`, 14 cases green, and `gates.py mcdc` still 100 % on the "
"subset."
msgstr ""
"影响范围：一个安全子集模块的类文档，以及任何计划过停机的调用方。代码没有"
"改动——行为是对的，中止才是那条有用的边。 `test_sm.cpp` 现在枚举这个关系"
"并在其上计算图性质（每个状态都能从 `Idle` 到达、 `Fault` 是唯一的汇、经 "
"`request()` 没有自环），所以那句话不再承重；头文件写明那七条边，并点名另"
"一个方向上唯一容易弄错的一点（ **`request(current)` 是一次拒绝，不是空操"
"作** ，所以每个周期都重申自己目标的监控层会把 `illegal_transitions()` 填"
"满）。重跑： `test_sm.cpp` ，14 个 case 为绿， `gates.py mcdc` 在这个子"
"集上仍是 100 %。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3001 70f84b9c0b2d4a55b4daaf4c5f2406ee
msgid ""
"The rule this produces: **a table checked against a copy of itself is not"
" checked.** For a state machine, the check with information in it is a "
"graph property computed from the *measured* relation -- reachability, "
"sinks, degrees -- because those are the things a reader of the prose is "
"actually relying on."
msgstr ""
"由此得出的规矩： **拿表与它自己的一份副本对照，等于没有对照。** 对一台状"
"态机来说，真正带有信息的检查是从 *实测* 关系上算出来的图性质——可达性、汇"
"、度数——因为那些才是读散文的人实际在依赖的东西。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3005 beba50e5117e49da9a165779b4272076
msgid "A-109"
msgstr ""
"A-109"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3007 d0beea914d334d1e854c05b471a12732
msgid ""
"**The first instrument for the saliency bias could not see it, and the "
"negative result read like a finding about the code.** Measuring the new "
"`DualInductanceObserver` against the shipped single-`L` observer on the "
"switching rig gave 0.13 to 0.15 rad for *both* of them at every d-axis "
"current -- i.e. \"the dual-inductance observer is useless\" -- while the "
"algebra says the whole difference is a closed form. At `psi_f = 4.76 mWb`"
" the 800 rad/s back-EMF is 3.8 V, so a few tenths of a volt of dead-time "
"volt-seconds is already 0.1 rad of flux angle: the impairment was the "
"size of the effect and common to both observers, so it cancelled nothing "
"and buried everything."
msgstr ""
"**用来量凸极偏差的第一件仪器看不见它，而那个阴性结果读起来像一条关于代码"
"的发现。** 在开关台架上拿新的 `DualInductanceObserver` 与随发行的单 `L` "
"观测器对照，在每一个 d 轴电流下 *两者* 都给出 0.13 到 0.15 rad——也就是说"
"“双电感观测器没有用”——而代数说整个差别是一个闭式。在 `psi_f = 4.76 mWb` "
"时，800 rad/s 的反电动势是 3.8 V，于是零点几伏的死区伏秒已经是 0.1 rad的"
"磁链角：那处损伤与被测效应同量级，而且两个观测器共有，所以它什么也没抵消"
"，却埋掉了一切。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3014 2cd0f7106de24e56bcb80bb3dabf2edf
msgid ""
"Surfaced by a **zero-current probe**. With no current neither model has a"
" saliency term to neglect, so whatever both still report is the "
"instrument itself: 0.0024 / 0.0096 / 0.0196 rad at 100 / 400 / 800 rad/s,"
" which is `w_e*dt/2`, the backward-Euler lag of the flux integrator, and "
"the line goes through all three points. What would have shown it first is"
" that same probe **before** the effect was measured -- it is one loop and"
" it costs a second."
msgstr ""
"它靠一个 **零电流探针** 浮出来。没有电流时两个模型都没有可忽略的凸极项，"
"所以两者仍然报出的就是仪器本身：100 / 400 / 800 rad/s 处 0.0024 / 0.0096"
"/0.0196 rad，这正是 `w_e*dt/2` ，磁链积分器的后向欧拉滞后，而那条线穿过"
"全部三个点。本该最先显示它的是 **在被测效应之前** 做同一个探针——那是一层"
"循环，花一秒。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3018 a4a66f4779bc4305a6e88ddf13ee2b38
msgid ""
"Blast radius: no existing claim moved, because the wrong reading was "
"never written down; the new row "
"(`core/observer/dual_inductance_observer.hpp`) and O-38 are its only "
"consumers. The table was retaken on a speed-locked plant driven by the "
"exact steady-state d-q voltage at 100 rad/s, where `w_e*dt/2` is 0.0025 "
"rad and the bias under test is 0.021 to 0.105 rad, and the 800 rad/s runs"
" are recorded inside the test as *not usable* rather than quoted. Re-run:"
" `test_dual_inductance_observer.cpp`, 5 cases green."
msgstr ""
"影响范围：没有既有主张移动，因为那个错误读数从未被写下；新的那一行（ `"
"core/observer/dual_inductance_observer.hpp` ）与 O-38 是它仅有的消费方。"
"表格在一个锁速的被控对象上重测，由 100 rad/s 下精确的稳态 d-q 电压驱动，"
"那里 `w_e*dt/2` 是 0.0025 rad，而被测的偏差是 0.021 到 0.105 rad，"
"800rad/s 的几次运行在测试内部被记为 *不可用* 而不是被引用。重跑： `"
"test_dual_inductance_observer.cpp` ，5 个 case 为绿。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3024 ce550c0d05ce4beaabfe0d7955ff53db
msgid ""
"The rule this produces: **measure the floor before the effect, and "
"measure it where the effect is zero by construction.** A floor subtracted"
" from a table is an assumption with a number next to it; a floor measured"
" at zero current is the instrument answering a question whose true answer"
" is known."
msgstr ""
"由此得出的规矩： **先量地板再量效应，并且在效应按构造为零的地方量它。** "
"从一张表里减掉的地板只是一个旁边写着数字的假设；在零电流处量到的地板，是"
"仪器在回答一个真值已知的问题。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3028 fd3a7046e7ac49f9895de0d891812e6b
msgid "F-109"
msgstr ""
"F-109"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3030 e3b07b6f92e64646b5af57ca8d732e6d
msgid ""
"**Four gates had never run in CI, and the workflow's gate list was a "
"second copy of the gate set.** `clocks`, `observability`, `combinations` "
"and `domain` were each implemented, registered in `PROJECT_GATES`, given "
"a dispatch branch in `gates.py`, and documented -- and the only workflow "
"that runs project gates enumerates gate names by hand and stopped at "
"`budget`. So they ran when a human typed them and never otherwise. Two of"
" the four carry this session's evidence chain (`observability`, "
"`combinations`), and one guards the F-105 timeout rule."
msgstr ""
"**有四道门禁从未在 CI 里跑过，而工作流里的门禁清单是门禁集合的第二份副本"
"。** `clocks` 、 `observability` 、 `combinations` 与 `domain` 各自实现"
"过、在 `PROJECT_GATES` 里登记过、在 `gates.py` 里给过分发分支、也写过文"
"档——而唯一运行项目门禁的那个工作流是手工枚举门禁名的，并且止于 `budget` "
"。于是它们只在有人手打时运行，别的时候从不。四道里有两道承载着本次会话的"
"证据链（ `observability` 、 `combinations` ），还有一道守着 F-105 的超时"
"规矩。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3036 b61e3c7e26044c2785af86e12a01e4aa
msgid ""
"Surfaced by asking \"does CI actually run the gate I just added\" during "
"a records-vs-implementation check: the records were consistent, and the "
"wiring was not. What would have shown it first is a comparison inside "
"`ci-policy`, which already knows the gate set -- it prints the local-only"
" exclusions -- but never compares it with what the workflows actually "
"enumerate. That comparison is now written into the workflow as a comment,"
" and the loop carries every non-local gate."
msgstr ""
"它是在一次“记录对实现”的核对里问“CI 真的跑我刚加的那道门禁吗”时浮出来的"
"：记录是一致的，接线不是。本该最先显示它的是 `ci-policy` 内部的一次比较—"
"—它早已知道门禁集合（它会打印只在本地跑的排除项），却从不拿这个集合与工"
"作流实际枚举的东西相比。那次比较现在以注释的形式写进工作流，而循环带上了"
"每一道非本地的门禁。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3041 35f5bc51ba2a4713b5c3cf0bc74ddd50
msgid ""
"Blast radius: no claim moved, because every one of the four was green "
"locally; what was missing was the enforcement, not the check. Re-run: the"
" widened loop, fifteen gates green on the runner, and `ci-policy` still "
"refuses the five whose cost belongs on a developer machine (`fmu`, "
"`mcdc`, `mutants`, `pil`, `plantref`)."
msgstr ""
"影响范围：没有主张移动，因为那四道每一道在本机都是绿的；缺的是执行，不是"
"检查。重跑：放宽后的循环在 runner 上十五道门禁为绿，而 `ci-policy` 仍然"
"拒绝那五道代价属于开发机的（ `fmu` 、 `mcdc` 、 `mutants` 、 `pil` 、 `"
"plantref` ）。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3046 0a58f72d6ab74bfeb848bce81f636475
msgid ""
"Third instance in one day of the same shape: **a second copy of a set "
"that is not derived from the set.** The first was "
"`foc_motor_set_observer`'s upper bound saying `FOC_OBSERVER_BLENDED` "
"instead of the last enumerator, so a new mode was refused; the second was"
" the bilingual note pair in `foc_types.h` where the Chinese half had been"
" false for several releases while the English half was right; this is the"
" third. The rule they produce: when a set already exists somewhere, the "
"consumer must derive from it or a gate must compare the two, because a "
"hand-maintained list of \"everything\" fails silently and the failure "
"looks like success."
msgstr ""
"一天里同一形状的第三例： **一个不从那集合推导出来的集合副本。** 第一例是"
" `foc_motor_set_observer` 的上界写着 `FOC_OBSERVER_BLENDED` 而不是最后一"
"个枚举值，于是一个新模式被拒绝；第二例是 `foc_types.h` 里那对双语注释，"
"中文那一半已经错了好几个发布，而英文那一半是对的；这是第三例。它们得出的"
"规矩：当一个集合已经存在于某处时，消费方必须从它推导，或者必须有一道门禁"
"把两者相比，因为一份手工维护的“全部”清单会静默失效，而那种失效看起来像成"
"功。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3054 b93e6310cf6a401f8e92f20cf3f920eb
msgid "A-110"
msgstr ""
"A-110"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3056 c19b34d180054c369ec76c1ad6306108
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**The instrument, not the library: the fifth observer member was never "
"configured.** The row read \"the dual-inductance observer is not hand-"
"over-safe and the deficit is pi\" -- 2.9834 rad 20 ms after the hand-over"
" against the other high-speed member's 0.7244, from the same inherited "
"0.5611. The real cause is that `observer_config()` in the rig never "
"assigned `config.dual_inductance`, so the member ran with an all-zero "
"`Config{0, 0, 0, 0}`, `valid_config` refused it, `update()` held its "
"state and the readout was a constant. With the member configured the two "
"land **0.6543** and **0.7244** rad out -- the same inherited error, 9.7 %"
" apart."
msgstr ""
"**是仪器的问题，不是库的问题：第五个观测器成员从未被配置。** 那一行原本"
"读作“双电感观测器不满足交接安全性，缺额是 pi”——交接后 20 ms 时 2.9834"
"rad，对照另一个高速成员的 0.7244，而二者继承的误差是同一个 0.5611。真正"
"的原因是台架里的 `observer_config()` 从未给 `config.dual_inductance` 赋"
"值，于是该成员带着全零的 `Config{0, 0, 0, 0}` 运行， `valid_config` 拒绝"
"它， `update()` 保持状态，读数是常数。成员配置好之后，两者分别偏出 **"
"0.6543** 与 **0.7244** rad——同一个继承误差，相差 9.7 %。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3062 516b8369aac0481bbd61d13b6cc3b6ff
msgid ""
"Surfaced by asking a criterion that had been withdrawn as *vacuous* (C2: "
"\"within 20 ms the angle is inside 0.05 rad\", withdrawn because the rig "
"it was written for was sensored). That refutation **stands**: both "
"members are far outside 0.05, and for the reason the rig can now name -- "
"the *outgoing* observer hands over an estimate that is 0.56 rad out, and "
"neither incoming member can forget it in 20 ms. What does not stand is "
"the claim that the incoming member was broken."
msgstr ""
"它靠追问一条已因 *空洞* 而撤回的判据浮出来（C2：“20 ms 内角度落在 "
"0.05rad之内”，撤回是因为它当初为之写的台架是带传感器的）。那次否证 **成"
"立** ：两个成员都远在 0.05 之外，而原因台架现在能指名—— *交出* 的那个观"
"测器交接的估计偏出 0.56 rad，接入的两个成员都无法在 20 ms 内忘掉它。不成"
"立的是“接入的那个成员坏了”这条主张。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3067 9bab04798d654c5f866b88f55b132c07
msgid ""
"The falsifier was in the case the whole time and pointed the wrong way: "
"it asserted `max_error > 2.0` \"so it goes red the day the member is "
"repaired\". A recorded failure asserts a *number*, so the first thing to "
"check when the number is a constant is whether the member is running at "
"all. `status()` returns `Param` for an invalid config, and a rig that "
"never reads it cannot tell a held output from a wrong algorithm -- the "
"two are identical at the port. The case now asserts faithfulness for both"
" members (0.8x to 2.0x the inherited error) and that the two agree within"
" 15 %, and every rig that configures a member it also selects now prints "
"the status."
msgstr ""
"那个否证器一直就在 case 里，而且指错了方向：它断言 `max_error > 2.0` ，“"
"以便成员被修好的那天它会变红”。一条记录下来的失败断言的是一个 *数* ，所"
"以当那个数是常数时，第一件要查的事是这个成员到底在不在跑。对一个无效配置"
"， `status()` 返回 `Param` ，而一个从不读它的台架分不出被保持的输出与错"
"误的算法——两者在端口上一模一样。这个 case 现在对两个成员都断言忠实性（继"
"承误差的 0.8x 到 2.0x），以及两者在 15 % 内一致，而每个既配置成员又选择"
"它的台架现在都会打印状态。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3074 780be9a87415490ca18514840468fe6b
msgid "F-111"
msgstr ""
"F-111"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3076 79de352820ac4fa2af94f4a02243d9b1
msgid ""
"**The flux-source correction is not a remedy for a wrong seed: it is a "
"nearest-point search and it changes branch.** With an exact seed the "
"corrected source is worth 7.71x under a nameplate `Rs` error (recorded in"
" O-56's neighbourhood as an L2 result). With the seed 0.30 rad off it is "
"8x **worse** at 0.2 A and 3.7x worse at 3 A (mean error 1.545 / 1.530 / "
"1.570 rad for the corrected source against 0.195 / 0.222 / 0.424 for the "
"pure integrator, exact `Rs`, 200 rad/s electrical, 2 s). So \"hand over, "
"then switch the correction on so the inherited error decays\" does not "
"work, and the flux source's measured domain is exactly *exact seed, "
"nameplate error* -- nothing wider."
msgstr ""
"**磁链源修正不是种子错误的补救：它是一次最近点搜索，而且它会换分支。** "
"在种子精确时，修正源在铭牌 `Rs` 误差下值 7.71 倍（作为一条 L2 结果记在"
"O-56 附近）。种子偏 0.30 rad 时，它在 0.2 A 处 **差** 8 倍，在 3 A 处差"
"3.7 倍（修正源的平均误差 1.545 / 1.530 / 1.570 rad，对照纯积分器的0.195/"
" 0.222 / 0.424， `Rs` 精确、200 rad/s 电角度、2 s）。所以“先交接，再把修"
"正打开让继承误差衰减”行不通，而磁链源实测的定义域恰是 *精确种子、铭牌误"
"差* ——一点都不更宽。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3083 a34cb85052114cefa482b4d0d6b4d586
msgid ""
"Surfaced while looking for a fix for F-110, i.e. before F-110 turned out "
"to be the rig's. The same behaviour shows in the chain: with "
"`FluxSource::Corrected` the dual-inductance member lands 2.9834 rad out "
"at gain 2 and 3.0830 at gain 0.2, against 0.6543 for the pure integrator."
msgstr ""
"它是在为 F-110 找修法时浮出来的，也就是在 F-110 被查明是台架的问题之前。"
"同一种行为在链里也出现：用 `FluxSource::Corrected` 时双电感成员在增益 2"
"下偏出 2.9834 rad、在增益 0.2 下偏出 3.0830，而纯积分器是 0.6543。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3086 fe104146a132499f8bdfb51a04117121
msgid ""
"The pull is a projection onto the flux curve, and an angular seed error "
"moves the *nearest* point to the other branch; the branch is then kept by"
" continuity and never revisited. Nothing in shipped code changes (the ABI"
" leaves the member on `Integrator`); what changes is the declaration, "
"which now carries the domain instead of selling the correction as an "
"upgrade."
msgstr ""
"那个牵引是一次到磁链曲线上的投影，而一个角度上的种子误差会把 *最近* 点移"
"到另一条分支上；此后分支靠连续性被保持，再也不被重新审视。随发行版的代码"
"没有任何改动（ABI 把这个成员留在 `Integrator` ）；改变的是那份声明，它现"
"在带着定义域，而不是把修正当成一次升级来推销。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3095 c83b834cd2fd4b2e9a673884731132fd
msgid "A-111"
msgstr ""
"A-111"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3097 9046201e43ed4de8a4a0ca6b69e5f9db
msgid ""
"**Upstream shipped both scaffold proposals, and nothing here would have "
"noticed.** `fcpp` v0.3.4 (`701a2452`) took the cppcheck argument "
"(`f2519753`, extended by `98ea19a1` to the C descriptor as well -- "
"`.h`/`.c` are linted by C, so the patch I proposed was incomplete) and "
"the bilingual filter fixes (`88f796b3`, plus `2f17bedd` stating the three"
" shapes). Our tree sat on v0.3.3 for two releases with two tolerated "
"forks that no longer had anything to tolerate."
msgstr ""
"**上游把两份 scaffold 提案都发了，而这里没有任何东西会注意到。** `fcpp` "
"v0.3.4（ `701a2452` ）采纳了 cppcheck 的实参（ `f2519753` ，并由 `"
"98ea19a1` 扩展到 C 描述符—— `.h` /`.c` 由 C 的检查管，所以我提的那个补丁"
"是不完整的），也采纳了双语过滤器的修复（ `88f796b3` ，另有 `2f17bedd` 把"
"三种形状写明）。本仓库的树在两个发布周期里停在 v0.3.3，还带着两处已经没"
"有东西可容忍的分叉。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3102 084b4e2dfeaa4f62ad5e621d0102e6a5
msgid ""
"Surfaced by the user reading upstream's release, **not** by this "
"repository: the `scaffold` gate compares the working tree against the "
"*pinned* bytes, so a newer upstream release is invisible to it. That is "
"the right design -- a gate that needs the network is not a gate -- but it"
" means the pin is a manual fact, and three artefacts had already gone "
"stale behind it: the `_comment` paragraph arguing the two forks \"cannot "
"be removed from the private side\" (true only while upstream had not "
"shipped), a `v0.3.3` literal in `scaffold_gate.py`'s own docstring, and a"
" `scaffold-baseline/docs/build.py` copy of v0.3.3 bytes that nothing "
"referenced once the tolerance disappeared."
msgstr ""
"它是由用户去读上游的发布浮出来的， **不是** 由这个仓库： `scaffold` 门禁"
"拿工作树与 *钉住的* 字节比，所以更新的上游发布对它不可见。那是正确的设计"
"——一道需要网络的门禁不是门禁——但这意味着那个钉子是一个手工事实，而它背后"
"已经有三件产物过时了：那段论证两处分叉“无法从私有侧移除”的 `_comment` （"
"只在上游尚未发布时成立）、 `scaffold_gate.py` 自己 docstring 里的一个 `"
"v0.3.3` 字面量，以及一份 `scaffold-baseline/docs/build.py` 的 v0.3.3 字"
"节副本——容忍消失之后没有任何东西再引用它。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3109 606d551603f249f592fdeb44e43714f6
msgid ""
"Pin moved to v0.3.4 with all 33 checked files re-hashed from the release "
"tree, `tolerated` emptied, `baseline_divergences` 2 -> **0**, the stale "
"baseline copy deleted, and the docstring made version-agnostic. The "
"adoption was verified rather than assumed: both `docs/build.py` versions "
"were run over all 61 public headers in both languages and produce "
"**122/122 identical** filtered outputs, so the merge changed no "
"documentation content. The rule this adds: **a pinned byte-check detects "
"drift from the pin, never the existence of a newer release** -- so the "
"pin carries the date it was last reviewed, and a scaffold release is a "
"scheduled task, not something a gate will remind anyone about."
msgstr ""
"钉子移到 v0.3.4，全部 33 个受检文件从发布树重新取哈希， `tolerated` 清空"
"， `baseline_divergences` 从 2 变为 **0** ，过时的基线副本删除，"
"docstring改成与版本无关。这次采纳是被验证的而不是假定的：两个版本的 `"
"docs/build.py` 都在全部 61 个公开头文件的两种语言上跑过，产出 **122/122"
"完全相同** 的过滤结果，所以这次合并没有改动任何文档内容。它新增的规矩： "
"**按钉住的字节检查能发现相对钉子的漂移，永远发现不了存在更新的发布** ——"
"所以钉子带着它上次被复核的日期，而 scaffold 的发布是一项排定的任务，不是"
"门禁会提醒任何人的事。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3119 66ee1b364462471fb4b6a28fd350b1f9
msgid "A-112"
msgstr ""
"A-112"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3121 494ebac009344e4499ad788f30362eec
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**A constant that had never been executed was wrong by 18 %, and it was "
"the one the plan was about to trust.** `oracle_ornl.py` carried "
"`LOCKED_ROTOR = [(75, 140), (150, 260), (250, 400)]`, transcribed from "
"ORNL/TM-2006/423's *summary* Table 6.3, and nothing in the repository "
"ever read it. The primary data is Table 3.2 (p.19): 7 currents x 23 shaft"
" angles, whose column peaks are **74.0 / 117.7 / 158.0 / 199.0 / 229.0 / "
"286.6 / 339.0 N.m** at 50..250 A. Every summary value is **1.14 to "
"1.19x** the primary peak at the same current (1.189 / 1.135 / 1.180), "
"i.e. a constant normalisation difference rather than a transcription slip"
" -- and using it as \"the measurement\" would have reported an 18 % error"
" in a parameter set that is within 3 %."
msgstr ""
"**一个从未被执行过的常数错了 18 %，而它正是计划即将依赖的那一个。** `"
"oracle_ornl.py` 带着 `LOCKED_ROTOR = [(75, 140), (150, 260), (250, 400)]"
"` ，从 ORNL/TM-2006/423 的 *汇总* 表 6.3 转录而来，而仓库里从来没有任何"
"东西读过它。原始数据是表 3.2（p.19）：7 个电流乘 23 个轴角，其列峰值在"
"50..250 A 处为 **74.0 / 117.7 / 158.0 / 199.0 / 229.0 / 286.6 / 339.0N.m"
"** 。每个汇总值都是同一电流下原始峰值的 **1.14 到 1.19 倍** （1.189"
"/1.135 / 1.180），即一个恒定的归一化差，而不是转录笔误——而把它当作“那次"
"测量”，会在一个误差在 3 % 以内的参数集上报出 18 % 的误差。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3129 cb351cf7524b4434a5245c7d89063644
msgid ""
"Surfaced by finally using it, as the cheap pre-check for B-2's charter. "
"The 1.80x gap between a 75 A point and an 82 N.m prediction was too large"
" to be physics, so the table was re-read from the PDF with `-layout`: "
"that also settled the unit -- the currents are **per-phase rms** (peak = "
"sqrt(2) I), proved by the 50 A point landing at **+0.7 %** and 125 A at "
"**+0.2 %** under that convention, against **-42 %** if the column value "
"were taken as a peak."
msgstr ""
"它靠终于被用起来才浮出，那是作为 B-2 章程的廉价预检。75 A 的点与 82 N.m"
"的预测之间 1.80 倍的差距太大，不可能是物理，于是用 `-layout` 从 PDF 重读"
"那张表：这同时把单位定了下来——电流是 **每相 rms** （峰值 = sqrt(2) I），"
"由该约定下 50 A 点落在 **+0.7 %** 、125 A 落在 **+0.2 %** 证明，而若把列"
"值当作峰值则是 **-42 %** 。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3134 628a2216f4274f13ad73352319eee094
msgid ""
"No kernel claim moves: this is `IPMSM_A`, which A-91 already says is not "
"this library's machine. What changes is the tool and the statement of "
"what the data can do. `--torque` now carries Table 3.2, a transcription "
"self-check (peaks monotone, mean below peak, the 6.3/3.2 ratio constant),"
" and a **sensitivity scan printed on every run**: these seven points pin "
"`psi_f` to **[0.93, 1.02]x** the ORNL value -- which rejects the FEMM "
"route (0.18826 Wb, **1.089x**, out of band at 150 A) on a measurement "
"that does not share its assumptions -- and pin `Lq - Ld` to essentially "
"**nothing** (`k` in [0, 1.1] passes, and `k = 0` passes, because the "
"reluctance term is a small share of the torque at these currents). The "
"first version of this check claimed to validate `Lq - Ld`; its own "
"sensitivity scan is what forced that sentence to be withdrawn, and it is "
"printed every run so the same claim cannot creep back."
msgstr ""
"内核主张没有移动：这是 `IPMSM_A` ，A-91 早已说明它不是本库的机器。改变的"
"是工具，以及对这批数据能做什么的陈述。 `--torque` 现在带着表 3.2、一次转"
"录自检（峰值单调、均值低于峰值、6.3/3.2 这个比值恒定），以及 **每次运行"
"都打印的敏感度扫描** ：这七个点把 `psi_f` 钉在 ORNL 值的 **[0.93, 1.02]x"
"** ——这就在一次不与它共用假设的测量上否掉了 FEMM 路线（0.18826 Wb， **"
"1.089x** ，在 150 A 处出带）——而把 `Lq - Ld` 钉在基本上 **什么都钉不住**"
" （ `k` 在[0, 1.1] 内通过， `k = 0` 也通过，因为磁阻项在这些电流下只占转"
"矩的一小份）。这项检查的第一版声称验证了 `Lq - Ld` ；正是它自己的敏感度"
"扫描迫使那句话被撤回，而它每次运行都打印，所以同一条主张爬不回来。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3146 5f0d81287b034597a4bd914e89a132bf
msgid "A-113"
msgstr ""
"A-113"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3148 4915dfc3e6fa498a966901ecc30f15e1
msgid ""
"**The same \"count the file set\" check was applied to one upstream "
"directory and not the other.** The scaffold gate has compared the *set* "
"of `.github/misc` since it was written -- \"a byte-check of the files "
"upstream ships cannot see a directory that has quietly grown extras\" -- "
"but `.github/workflows` got only the byte comparison of the ten files "
"upstream ships. This project adds an eleventh, `project-gates.yml`, so "
"for the whole life of the private gate suite there has been a CI file in "
"the template's directory that nothing checked and nothing named. The "
"claim itself was honest (\"the scaffold's build and CI files are byte-"
"identical to the pinned release\"), which is exactly why nobody looked: a"
" scoped claim that is true hides the unscoped question next to it."
msgstr ""
"**同一条“数文件集”的检查被用于一个上游目录，却没有用于另一个。** "
"scaffold门禁从写下之日起就比较 `.github/misc` 的 *集合* ——“对上游所发文"
"件的字节检查看不见一个悄悄多长出东西的目录”——但 `.github/workflows` 只得"
"到了对上游所发那十个文件的字节比较。这个项目加了第十一个， `"
"project-gates.yml` ，于是在这套私有门禁存在的整个期间，模板的目录里有一"
"个 CI 文件，没有任何东西检查它，也没有任何东西提到它。那条主张本身是诚实"
"的（“scaffold 的构建与CI 文件与钉住的发布逐字节相同”），这恰是没人去看的"
"原因：一条限定范围且成立的主张，把它旁边那个未限定范围的问题盖住了。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3156 fdc1a645a5f8422daa49eb9e12f0adf5
msgid ""
"Surfaced while answering \"is this repository really 0-IaC-change on the "
"template\": the answer needed the inventory rather than the claim, and "
"the inventory took one `ls` against the release tree. Nothing was "
"misbehaving -- the private workflow is deliberate -- so the defect is "
"entirely in what was *recorded*."
msgstr ""
"它是在回答“这个仓库对模板真的是 0-IaC-改动吗”时浮出来的：答案要的是清单"
"而不是主张，而清单只需对发布树做一次 `ls` 。没有任何东西在出错——那个私有"
"工作流是有意为之——所以缺陷完全在 *记录* 里。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3159 81b26017bfee4a889552f0e6d4e81fe6
msgid ""
"`.github/workflows` joined `owned_dirs` with `project-gates.yml` as a "
"declared addition, and the check was shown to bite before being trusted: "
"adding a stray `stray-test.yml` turns the gate red, removing it turns it "
"green. `.github/skills` is still outside the byte check (agent guidance "
"is project-specific by design) but its count is now recorded rather than "
"implied: 39 upstream files, 39 tracked, **15 of them rewritten** here. "
"The general form: **\"zero modifications\" is a claim about files "
"upstream ships; the question next to it is \"zero additions to "
"directories upstream ships\", and only a set comparison answers that.**"
msgstr ""
"`.github/workflows` 加入了 `owned_dirs` ，并把 `project-gates.yml` 声明"
"为新增，而这项检查在被信任之前先被证明会咬人：加一个多余的 `"
"stray-test.yml` 门禁就变红，删掉它就变绿。 `.github/skills` 仍在字节检查"
"之外（agent 指引按设计就是项目专有的），但它的数量现在被记录下来而不是被"
"默认：上游 39个文件，跟踪 39 个，其中 **15 个在这里被改写** 。一般形式是"
"： **“零修改”是一句关于上游所发文件的主张；它旁边的问题是“对上游所发目录"
"零新增”，而只有集合比较才能回答那个问题。**"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3169 d194ee3df36543149624f52c870dabf6
msgid "What ``pending`` means in the commit column"
msgstr ""
"提交列里 ``pending`` 的含义"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3171 6a7940d8835f46a6ba3ee8dec7e3d06d
msgid ""
"A row cannot cite the hash of the commit that contains it, and these rows"
" are written in the same commit as the fix, so 154 of the 167 say "
"``pending``. Both counts are grepped from the table, not counted by hand "
"-- the previous version of this sentence was two rows out, which is "
"exactly the kind of number that goes stale while reading as a fact, and "
"it had gone stale again before this line was corrected again. That is a "
"convention and it was, until this paragraph, an unstated one -- which is "
"the same defect the rows themselves are about. The row is recoverable "
"rather than lost:"
msgstr ""
"一行不可能引用包含它自己的那次提交的哈希，而这些行是与修复写在同一次提交"
"里的，所以 167 行里有 154 行写的是 ``pending`` 。两个数字都是从表里 grep"
"出来的，不是手数的——这句话的上一版差了两行，而那正是那种一边读起来像事实"
"、一边过时的数字，而在这条又被更正之前它已经再次过时了。这本身是一条约定"
"，而在这一段之前它是一条未写明的约定——这与那些行本身所谈的是同一种缺陷。"
"那一行是可找回的，而不是丢了："

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3179 dc99ff9fc8ac4af282b96bd6b3d78e60
msgid ""
"prints every commit that added or removed that string, and the earliest "
"of them is the commit that introduced the row (verified for A-16, A-13, "
"C-5 and F-9). A hash in that column therefore means \"the row was written"
" later, and cites the commit that carried the fix\"; ``pending`` means "
"\"the fix and the row are the same commit, use the command above\"."
msgstr ""
"打印每一条新增或删除该字符串的提交，其中最早的那条就是引入这一行的提交（"
"已对 A-16、A-13、C-5 与 F-9 核实）。因此那一列里的一个哈希意味着“这一行"
"是后来写的，引用的是承载修复的那次提交”； ``pending`` 意味着“修复与这一"
"行是同一次提交，用上面那条命令”。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3184 cb5ca493b509479f9c56a261bc6158c1
msgid "How the table's shape is kept"
msgstr ""
"表格形状的维持方式"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3186 da732021ee554578a4a2c3d1ad0ec37a
msgid ""
"A ``list-table`` whose rows disagree with its header does not render "
"badly -- it renders as **nothing**. Sphinx emits ``ERROR: Error parsing "
"content block for the \"list-table\" directive`` and drops the table "
"whole, and ``docs-build.yml`` greps the build log for ``ERROR:`` and "
"fails the job. So a ragged row is both invisible in the page and fatal in"
" CI, while ``gates.py docs`` -- which ran the Doxygen formatter and the "
"number sheet and nothing that parses rST -- stayed green. 25 rows were in"
" that state, the widest of them carrying 19 items against a 6-column "
"header, all of them added while appending findings paragraph by paragraph"
" with a ``-`` that starts a new cell."
msgstr ""
"一个行与表头不符的 ``list-table`` 不是渲染得难看——它渲染成 **什么都没有*"
"* 。Sphinx 抛出 ``ERROR: Error parsing content block for the \""
"list-table\" directive`` 并整张表丢掉，而 ``docs-build.yml`` 在构建日志"
"里 grep ``ERROR:`` 并让该 job 失败。所以一行参差不齐的条目在页面上不可见"
"、在 CI 里致命，而 ``gates.py docs`` ——它跑 Doxygen 格式化器与数字表，没"
"有任何解析rST 的东西——一直是绿的。当时有 25 行处于那种状态，最宽的一行在"
"6 列表头下带了 19 项，它们全都是在逐段追加发现时、用一个开启新单元格的 `"
"`-`` 加进去的。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3193 fb729b83981e42c3a7ca6948497815e3
msgid ""
"The repair was mechanical and is asserted to be lossless: "
"``.github/project/rst_table.py fix`` merges the surplus paragraphs into "
"the \"how it surfaced\" cell as extra paragraphs and leaves columns empty"
" where a row genuinely has nothing for them, and it refuses to write "
"unless the whole file's word sequence is unchanged. ``gates.py docs`` now"
" runs its ``check`` mode, which needs no docutils, so the check cannot "
"silently skip on a machine without Sphinx. The habit that prevents a "
"recurrence: a new row is six items -- ID, class, root cause, how it "
"surfaced, blast radius, commit -- and a second paragraph belongs inside a"
" cell at seven spaces of indent, not behind another ``-``."
msgstr ""
"修复是机械的，并断言为无损： ``.github/project/rst_table.py fix`` 把多余"
"的段落并入“如何浮出”那一格作为额外的段落，在某一格确实没有内容的地方留空"
"，而且在整份文件的词序列未变之前拒绝写入。 ``gates.py docs`` 现在跑它的 "
"``check`` 模式，那不需要 docutils，所以这项检查无法在没装 Sphinx 的机器"
"上静默跳过。防复发的习惯：一行新条目是六项——ID、类别、根因、如何浮出、影"
"响范围、提交——而第二段应当以七个空格的缩进留在某一格之内，而不是接在另一"
"个 ``-`` 后面。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3201 ab67cee82bef449aa21346d6d4192f93
msgid "Two kinds of row that are currently empty"
msgstr ""
"目前仍空着的两类条目"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3203 a42f8cabadef4f659ba480d91a9c27e3
msgid ""
"The page is honest about its own coverage too. There are two kinds of row"
" this log expects and does not yet contain, and their absence is a fact "
"about the work so far, not a guarantee that the categories are empty:"
msgstr ""
"这个页面对自己的覆盖情况也是诚实的。本日志预期存在、而目前尚未包含的条目"
"有两类，它们的缺席是关于迄今工作的事实，而不是“这两类本来就是空的”的保证"
"："

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3206 23710bd321eb4d63b5fb7a040cbf00e4
msgid ""
"**A claim that shrank.** When a defect cannot be found within three "
"attempts, the rule is to stop and lower the claim (an L3 becomes an L2, "
"or becomes \"not claimed\") instead of shipping a number nobody can "
"explain. That has not happened yet -- which means no claim here has been "
"tested to destruction."
msgstr ""
"**一条缩小的主张。** 当缺陷在三次尝试之内找不到时，规矩是停下并降低主张"
"（一个 L3 变成 L2，或变成“不作主张”），而不是发布一个没人能解释的数字。"
"这还没有发生过——这意味着这里没有任何主张被测试到摧毁。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3209 e3fb6c4127934663ad16b473d94c69f9
msgid ""
"**An unexplained pass.** A case that is green for a reason the author "
"cannot state is treated as red. Nobody has written one down yet."
msgstr ""
"**一次无法解释的通过。** 一个绿得连作者都说不出原因的 case 按红处理。还"
"没有人写下过一例。"

#: ../../source/foundation-log.rst:3212 60693eefc0a64cf69de740e52617b1b9
msgid "Both will be rows when they happen, with the same weight as the defects."
msgstr ""
"两者一旦发生都会成为条目，其分量与缺陷相同。"

